(1258162, 161139, 5354, '<td valign="top">This image doesn''t say ''stressed'' to me. I think your title and the image are not too well matched. Within the portraite the background is very distracting and the main focus on the bride''s face is her ear (the lightest part). Compositionally this image doesn''t really work.<br/>Having said all that its not a bad image, just needs some more thought and some time taken over arranging the main parts. I guess this was taken quickly as a grab shot due to the circumstances and to be honest that shows.</td>', 'This image doesn''t say ''stressed'' to me. I think your title and the image are not too well matched. Within the portraite the background is very distracting and the main focus on the bride''s face is her ear (the lightest part). Compositionally this image doesn''t really work.Having said all that its not a bad image, just needs some more thought and some time taken over arranging the main parts. I guess this was taken quickly as a grab shot due to the circumstances and to be honest that shows.', '2005-03-30 04:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258164, 159525, 30861, '<td valign="top">A most unfortunate title for a stunning cloud shot. Clouds have nothing to do with the concept of evolution. But the image ties in very well with "creating the heavens"</td>', 'A most unfortunate title for a stunning cloud shot. Clouds have nothing to do with the concept of evolution. But the image ties in very well with "creating the heavens"', '2005-03-30 04:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258166, 159636, 30861, '<td valign="top">Just as an aside, how could the "newborn" earth have modern continental divisions? an amusing image, marred by an unnatural giglight on the left eggshell.</td>', 'Just as an aside, how could the "newborn" earth have modern continental divisions? an amusing image, marred by an unnatural giglight on the left eggshell.', '2005-03-30 04:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258167, 160822, 5354, '<td valign="top">Shooting up into a bright sky is always goinf to fool the exposure meter. You have lost much of the detail in the feathers, producing a semi-silhouette and the angle is particularly unflattering.</td>', 'Shooting up into a bright sky is always goinf to fool the exposure meter. You have lost much of the detail in the feathers, producing a semi-silhouette and the angle is particularly unflattering.', '2005-03-30 04:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258168, 161265, 24330, '<td valign="top">do it again, please oh please, go on , go on.</td>', 'do it again, please oh please, go on , go on.', '2005-03-30 04:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258169, 161286, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is funny as hell. double bump for concept and title. as an image, it''s not so hot I''m afraiud, but it made me laugh out loud.</td>', 'This is funny as hell. double bump for concept and title. as an image, it''s not so hot I''m afraiud, but it made me laugh out loud.', '2005-03-30 04:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258170, 160941, 5354, '<td valign="top">The weather looks dismal, and you don''t appear to have enhanced that with additional lighting. The image has no ''lift'', the flat grey and flat light just portray ''late winter'' instead of ''early spring'' to me.</td>', 'The weather looks dismal, and you don''t appear to have enhanced that with additional lighting. The image has no ''lift'', the flat grey and flat light just portray ''late winter'' instead of ''early spring'' to me.', '2005-03-30 04:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258171, 160842, 5354, '<td valign="top">The ticking clock has been done so many times it has to be pretty special to get much above average marks. This is a reasonable attempt, but there is no new element which would make me say ''Wow'' thats different.</td>', 'The ticking clock has been done so many times it has to be pretty special to get much above average marks. This is a reasonable attempt, but there is no new element which would make me say ''Wow'' thats different.', '2005-03-30 04:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258174, 161078, 5354, '<td valign="top">You have chosen to make this difficult for yourself by using a white backdrop and a black object. You have exposed correctly for the background retaining detail in the creases and folds whilst losing the detail in the object. One or one and a half stops more would have been perfect.</td>', 'You have chosen to make this difficult for yourself by using a white backdrop and a black object. You have exposed correctly for the background retaining detail in the creases and folds whilst losing the detail in the object. One or one and a half stops more would have been perfect.', '2005-03-30 04:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258175, 160756, 5354, '<td valign="top">The exposure and colour cast on this image really need to be looked at in photoshop. If you shoot RAW then these errors can easily be fixed.</td>', 'The exposure and colour cast on this image really need to be looked at in photoshop. If you shoot RAW then these errors can easily be fixed.', '2005-03-30 04:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258177, 161088, 5354, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept, and very well excecuted. One of my favourites</td>', 'Excellent concept, and very well excecuted. One of my favourites', '2005-03-30 04:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258179, 160757, 5354, '<td valign="top">Yes I can see the link with the theme of the challenge, but there is little else to commend this image. There is no added ''WOW'', nothing to make voters give it more than an average score. Now if you had a young couple coming out holding hands and gazing at each other, or something to tell a story that would be a different thing. As it is, its flat and one dimensional. Sorry to be so brutal.</td>', 'Yes I can see the link with the theme of the challenge, but there is little else to commend this image. There is no added ''WOW'', nothing to make voters give it more than an average score. Now if you had a young couple coming out holding hands and gazing at each other, or something to tell a story that would be a different thing. As it is, its flat and one dimensional. Sorry to be so brutal.', '2005-03-30 04:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258180, 159607, 28801, '<td valign="top">I struggle to see what value the car adds to the picture of the pyramid</td>', 'I struggle to see what value the car adds to the picture of the pyramid', '2005-03-30 04:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258183, 159474, 5354, '<td valign="top">Going for the ''ahhh'' factor ;-)<br/>This opportunity could have been exploited so much better, maybe 3 or 4 of these little gus lined up suckling from the bitch, in soft light maybe from a log fire ....<br/>as it is we see a hand taking most of the frame, with acres of wasted space on the left. Harsh lighting doesn''t help either.<br/> <br/>I know that sounds brutal but with some more thought and application this had so much to offer and you wasted it.</td>', 'Going for the ''ahhh'' factor ;-)This opportunity could have been exploited so much better, maybe 3 or 4 of these little gus lined up suckling from the bitch, in soft light maybe from a log fire ....as it is we see a hand taking most of the frame, with acres of wasted space on the left. Harsh lighting doesn''t help either. I know that sounds brutal but with some more thought and application this had so much to offer and you wasted it.', '2005-03-30 04:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258186, 159241, 5354, '<td valign="top">The lighting feels very harsh</td>', 'The lighting feels very harsh', '2005-03-30 04:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258187, 159412, 28801, '<td valign="top">Cant really tell what this is</td>', 'Cant really tell what this is', '2005-03-30 04:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258188, 160943, 5354, '<td valign="top">Not exactly sure how this relates to ''beginning'', but nice enough rendition of a theme used here many times before.</td>', 'Not exactly sure how this relates to ''beginning'', but nice enough rendition of a theme used here many times before.', '2005-03-30 04:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258189, 161174, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice play on the theme. Somehow the contrast feels a little low.</td>', 'Nice play on the theme. Somehow the contrast feels a little low.', '2005-03-30 04:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258191, 159647, 28801, '<td valign="top">Fitting picture but the streak at the right detracts from it</td>', 'Fitting picture but the streak at the right detracts from it', '2005-03-30 04:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258192, 161062, 5354, '<td valign="top">size matters !!!!</td>', 'size matters !!!!', '2005-03-30 04:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258196, 161317, 5354, '<td valign="top">Just an observation ... toys, dolls and childrens rarely do well at DPC</td>', 'Just an observation ... toys, dolls and childrens rarely do well at DPC', '2005-03-30 04:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258197, 161288, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good subject. The trees have nice balance, and the fence is a good compliment to them. Combined they have nice lines that allow the eye to travel along in a nice circle amid the nice colored flowers of the field. A nice pleasant feel overall. However, IMO, it seems like if the lower portion of the field were cropped out (about up to just below the lower right corner of fence) it would make a much stronger composition.</td>', 'Good subject. The trees have nice balance, and the fence is a good compliment to them. Combined they have nice lines that allow the eye to travel along in a nice circle amid the nice colored flowers of the field. A nice pleasant feel overall. However, IMO, it seems like if the lower portion of the field were cropped out (about up to just below the lower right corner of fence) it would make a much stronger composition.', '2005-03-30 04:43:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258200, 161125, 5354, '<td valign="top">The lighting on the day you chose to take this was dismal. With some nice early morning side light it might have been better.</td>', 'The lighting on the day you chose to take this was dismal. With some nice early morning side light it might have been better.', '2005-03-30 04:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258202, 160007, 19831, '<td valign="top">Composition is good. Nice lines to the paths. Seems kind of blown out in the middle and IMO, not a real strong connection to the challenge topic.</td>', 'Composition is good. Nice lines to the paths. Seems kind of blown out in the middle and IMO, not a real strong connection to the challenge topic.', '2005-03-30 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258204, 161075, 5354, '<td valign="top">Depth of field really lets you down here. This needs to be ''sharp'' for more than just the first millimeter or two. The border you have chosen only really shows itself against the yellow which makes it feel unbalanced.</td>', 'Depth of field really lets you down here. This needs to be ''sharp'' for more than just the first millimeter or two. The border you have chosen only really shows itself against the yellow which makes it feel unbalanced.', '2005-03-30 04:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258206, 159938, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good subject. Great colors. Dof seems just a tad bit too shallow for me and kind of a static composition imo.</td>', 'Good subject. Great colors. Dof seems just a tad bit too shallow for me and kind of a static composition imo.', '2005-03-30 04:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258208, 159956, 5354, '<td valign="top">This would be a nice family snap. However in a photography challenge it is sadly lacking in technique. The lighting is very harsh (guessing onboard flash), the pose is ''startling'', and the dribbles down the shirt don''t help. Sorry to be so brutal.</td>', 'This would be a nice family snap. However in a photography challenge it is sadly lacking in technique. The lighting is very harsh (guessing onboard flash), the pose is ''startling'', and the dribbles down the shirt don''t help. Sorry to be so brutal.', '2005-03-30 04:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258211, 161306, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good subject for the challenge topic. Photo seems kind of busy though to me and lacking any strong focal point. Maybe boosting the color of the buds would help or catching it in slightly brighter light.</td>', 'Good subject for the challenge topic. Photo seems kind of busy though to me and lacking any strong focal point. Maybe boosting the color of the buds would help or catching it in slightly brighter light.', '2005-03-30 04:53:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258215, 160959, 5354, '<td valign="top">The phrase which jumped into my head when I viewed this image was '' well, which bit am I supposed to be looking at?'' - the depth of field and yous selction of a bud in the midground is confusing. Either more dof or selecting a more prominent focal point would help.</td>', 'The phrase which jumped into my head when I viewed this image was '' well, which bit am I supposed to be looking at?'' - the depth of field and yous selction of a bud in the midground is confusing. Either more dof or selecting a more prominent focal point would help.', '2005-03-30 04:56:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258217, 159412, 5354, '<td valign="top">size matters !!</td>', 'size matters !!', '2005-03-30 04:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258218, 161285, 5354, '<td valign="top">The post processing has gone too far for me</td>', 'The post processing has gone too far for me', '2005-03-30 04:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258221, 160625, 5354, '<td valign="top">Nice grab, shame about the tree on the right</td>', 'Nice grab, shame about the tree on the right', '2005-03-30 04:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258222, 159474, 19831, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge very well IMO. Like your focus and lighting. I also like how you''ve executed the shot, I''ve seen it done before and quite often, the shot ends up spoiled by catching a cluttered background. You''ve quite nicely focused the attention on your subject. Nice job.</td>', 'Fits the challenge very well IMO. Like your focus and lighting. I also like how you''ve executed the shot, I''ve seen it done before and quite often, the shot ends up spoiled by catching a cluttered background. You''ve quite nicely focused the attention on your subject. Nice job.', '2005-03-30 04:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258230, 159663, 34804, '<td valign="top">Not sure this fits the theme, but neat looking</td>', 'Not sure this fits the theme, but neat looking', '2005-03-30 05:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258231, 159735, 35517, '<td valign="top">i like this, i especially like the composition, how the turtle is only a 1/3 in the frame, and the fish up the top left is just under the suface. It certainly could be ''In the beginning''.. well done.</td>', 'i like this, i especially like the composition, how the turtle is only a 1/3 in the frame, and the fish up the top left is just under the suface. It certainly could be ''In the beginning''.. well done.', '2005-03-30 05:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
