(1258289, 161286, 21216, '<td valign="top">:D Fabulously funny, it just made me laugh. But hey, if he can afford a starbuck''s coffee, he can very well afford a tweezer no?</td>', ':D Fabulously funny, it just made me laugh. But hey, if he can afford a starbuck''s coffee, he can very well afford a tweezer no?', '2005-03-30 06:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258291, 160230, 21216, '<td valign="top">And then we get shaven and later eaten.<br/> <br/>The image is magnificent, one of my favorites for the challenge. I love the colors, especially the little ribbon (Could it be your future title on dpchallenge?) which contrats well with the grass. The soft lighting and the DOF isolates the subject I don''t know why but in a very innocent manner. I actually love the fact, that the coat is imperfect, that there''s dirt and yellowness on the fur, it makes it well too real and fitting to the challenge. I really can''t find anything wrong here.</td>', 'And then we get shaven and later eaten. The image is magnificent, one of my favorites for the challenge. I love the colors, especially the little ribbon (Could it be your future title on dpchallenge?) which contrats well with the grass. The soft lighting and the DOF isolates the subject I don''t know why but in a very innocent manner. I actually love the fact, that the coat is imperfect, that there''s dirt and yellowness on the fur, it makes it well too real and fitting to the challenge. I really can''t find anything wrong here.', '2005-03-30 06:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
