(1258542, 161129, 29797, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, especially for the challenge. Just a tip - with a bright sky like this in the background, expose for the sky (or at least a couple stops down) so you get more detail in the plume/smoke. You can adjust shadow contrast later in post-processing if the rocks turn out too dark. Or try just cropping out the sky altogether in this one.</td>', 'Nice shot, especially for the challenge. Just a tip - with a bright sky like this in the background, expose for the sky (or at least a couple stops down) so you get more detail in the plume/smoke. You can adjust shadow contrast later in post-processing if the rocks turn out too dark. Or try just cropping out the sky altogether in this one.', '2005-03-30 10:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
