(1258754, 159505, 34838, '<td valign="top">This is one of the original, Great pic--10</td>', 'This is one of the original, Great pic--10', '2005-03-30 11:46:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258758, 161311, 33560, '<td valign="top">Being a little dyslexic, I get the connection and find it amusing though not terribly surprising since I nearly did the same thing myself.   It''s a nice composition.  I like the colors, the whimsy, the good depth of field, and the negative space.  But isn''t there a rule at this site that no stuffed animal photo may score more than 3?  What the heck. I break rules all the time...</td>', 'Being a little dyslexic, I get the connection and find it amusing though not terribly surprising since I nearly did the same thing myself.   It''s a nice composition.  I like the colors, the whimsy, the good depth of field, and the negative space.  But isn''t there a rule at this site that no stuffed animal photo may score more than 3?  What the heck. I break rules all the time...', '2005-03-30 11:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
