(1258789, 159748, 33560, '<td valign="top">Was there life before the ninteenth century? I guess ninteenth century changed the way we view our beginnings.  Okay, got the connection.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Was there life before the ninteenth century? I guess ninteenth century changed the way we view our beginnings.  Okay, got the connection.  Nice photo.', '2005-03-30 12:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258791, 161172, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...the lighting is perfect! 10!!</td>', 'Beautiful...the lighting is perfect! 10!!', '2005-03-30 12:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258794, 160822, 35334, '<td valign="top">beginning?</td>', 'beginning?', '2005-03-30 12:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258795, 160751, 33560, '<td valign="top">The novelty of these glass chess boards is beginning to wear off for me.  It''s a pretty shot.  I think I would have cropped it so that the white pawn is on its own. Any chess player would get it.  This owuld cut out rows of slightly out of focus men.  And it would provide a greater sense of drama ''one against many.''</td>', 'The novelty of these glass chess boards is beginning to wear off for me.  It''s a pretty shot.  I think I would have cropped it so that the white pawn is on its own. Any chess player would get it.  This owuld cut out rows of slightly out of focus men.  And it would provide a greater sense of drama ''one against many.''', '2005-03-30 12:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258798, 160744, 33560, '<td valign="top">OOF!  Glad to see she''s wearing the right protective gear.  It''s a really great capture.    The soft lighting helps us to see the subjects face, but otherwise it makes much of the photo feel flat.</td>', 'OOF!  Glad to see she''s wearing the right protective gear.  It''s a really great capture.    The soft lighting helps us to see the subjects face, but otherwise it makes much of the photo feel flat.', '2005-03-30 12:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258800, 160943, 35334, '<td valign="top">beginning?</td>', 'beginning?', '2005-03-30 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258802, 161285, 35334, '<td valign="top">What happened to those colors?</td>', 'What happened to those colors?', '2005-03-30 12:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258803, 159583, 32792, '<td valign="top">Now this brings me back a lot of memories!<br/>Colors are a bit washed out and also de DOF is kinda weird. This could have worked a lot better if you worked the shooting area (maybe a colored sheed as background, better lighting and so...)</td>', 'Now this brings me back a lot of memories!Colors are a bit washed out and also de DOF is kinda weird. This could have worked a lot better if you worked the shooting area (maybe a colored sheed as background, better lighting and so...)', '2005-03-30 12:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258804, 160600, 27399, '<td valign="top">Simple, yet GREAT! When I look at it there is nothing that I would change, but it''s missing the sense of "wow" that I need in order to give a perfect score, but 9 is still good.</td>', 'Simple, yet GREAT! When I look at it there is nothing that I would change, but it''s missing the sense of "wow" that I need in order to give a perfect score, but 9 is still good.', '2005-03-30 12:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258805, 159085, 33560, '<td valign="top">Call me crazy, but aqua seems the wrong color for reminiscences and flashbacks.    I admit that it pairs well with aluminum, but there seems to be a yellowish tint  - perhaps its the lighting - that begs for sepia toned treatment.  There is something about the way the two cameras overlap that seems haphazard and confusing.  Both of these points are quibbles, but they do make a substantioal difference in my own opinion of the photo.</td>', 'Call me crazy, but aqua seems the wrong color for reminiscences and flashbacks.    I admit that it pairs well with aluminum, but there seems to be a yellowish tint  - perhaps its the lighting - that begs for sepia toned treatment.  There is something about the way the two cameras overlap that seems haphazard and confusing.  Both of these points are quibbles, but they do make a substantioal difference in my own opinion of the photo.', '2005-03-30 12:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258807, 161230, 32792, '<td valign="top">Focus seems way too soft for this macro. Looks like it''s been oversharpened as well. Good idea, too bad there are way too many alike on this challenge.</td>', 'Focus seems way too soft for this macro. Looks like it''s been oversharpened as well. Good idea, too bad there are way too many alike on this challenge.', '2005-03-30 12:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258808, 159745, 32792, '<td valign="top">The so much hated egg makes it''s appearance, but in a very lovely way.<br/>I really liked that you didn''t use a white one! GJ</td>', 'The so much hated egg makes it''s appearance, but in a very lovely way.I really liked that you didn''t use a white one! GJ', '2005-03-30 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1);
