(1258829, 159745, 34887, '<td valign="top">I know a lot of folks are sick of egg shots, but this is beautiful! The tonal changes on the egg are increadible. Good choice using a brown egg. Very interesting picture. Fits the challenge well (also could fit the stock quite well as well). Good job</td>', 'I know a lot of folks are sick of egg shots, but this is beautiful! The tonal changes on the egg are increadible. Good choice using a brown egg. Very interesting picture. Fits the challenge well (also could fit the stock quite well as well). Good job', '2005-03-30 12:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258830, 160807, 33560, '<td valign="top">As soon as you''ve finished there, you will want to go to your computer and download Neat Image. //www.neatimage.com.  And get some photographic lights.  And a digital camera. Really, the amount of banding in this photo makes me wonder whether it was scanned from a badly done digital print.  Most of the photo is out of focus, a remarkable feat considering that the required depth of field be not four inches, and this is not a Macro shot.</td>', 'As soon as you''ve finished there, you will want to go to your computer and download Neat Image. //www.neatimage.com.  And get some photographic lights.  And a digital camera. Really, the amount of banding in this photo makes me wonder whether it was scanned from a badly done digital print.  Most of the photo is out of focus, a remarkable feat considering that the required depth of field be not four inches, and this is not a Macro shot.', '2005-03-30 12:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
