(1258913, 159474, 21473, '<td valign="top">awww!</td>', 'awww!', '2005-03-30 12:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1258914, 161115, 33560, '<td valign="top">How is it, I''ve often wondered, that we can be in a field of flowers and find them completely wonderful, but when we capture that on film the glory is gone.  One hint lies in the fact that when one captures the field of flowers on 4x5 film and prints it on a high resolution two-page spread some of that glory is recaptured.  This photo depicts a sky that, in real life was beautiful, and a field of flowers that, in real life were beautiful.  But IMO, the qualities of neither is well expressed in the photo.  The sky want more drama. The ground needs more detail.  It is nice to see spring, though. Thanks.</td>', 'How is it, I''ve often wondered, that we can be in a field of flowers and find them completely wonderful, but when we capture that on film the glory is gone.  One hint lies in the fact that when one captures the field of flowers on 4x5 film and prints it on a high resolution two-page spread some of that glory is recaptured.  This photo depicts a sky that, in real life was beautiful, and a field of flowers that, in real life were beautiful.  But IMO, the qualities of neither is well expressed in the photo.  The sky want more drama. The ground needs more detail.  It is nice to see spring, though. Thanks.', '2005-03-30 12:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
