(1259073, 160865, 33560, '<td valign="top">Negative space.  It''s the rage.   But I''m an Apple  fan.  Apple ad agencies almost singlehandedly created negative space in the late 1980''s.  And as with any 20 year old fad, I look forward to the time its overuse is over.  If I were going to do this photo,  rotate and crop so that the bird was near a corner and facing (just about) the opposite corner.  But then I''m not a graphic artist by training.</td>', 'Negative space.  It''s the rage.   But I''m an Apple  fan.  Apple ad agencies almost singlehandedly created negative space in the late 1980''s.  And as with any 20 year old fad, I look forward to the time its overuse is over.  If I were going to do this photo,  rotate and crop so that the bird was near a corner and facing (just about) the opposite corner.  But then I''m not a graphic artist by training.', '2005-03-30 14:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1259074, 161082, 9478, '<td valign="top">Very nice colour and composition. Perhaps too much out of focus.</td>', 'Very nice colour and composition. Perhaps too much out of focus.', '2005-03-30 14:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
