(1259091, 161066, 33560, '<td valign="top">Yoho! where is this?  It''s a fantastic photo location, photographed at the most flattering time of day.  <br/>This reminds me of a number of famous old landscape paintings some, I think, by eighteenth century American painters, others by the Dutch masters.  (Not up on my art history, would appreciate help here.) <br/> <br/>If I scored this by what I see on my monitor, I''d be hard pressed to give it more than a 6 or 7.    But it is so strongly evokative of big, beautiful canvasses that I think I can push it up a little.  I doubt I''ll be voting with the crowd, but what''s new.</td>', 'Yoho! where is this?  It''s a fantastic photo location, photographed at the most flattering time of day.  This reminds me of a number of famous old landscape paintings some, I think, by eighteenth century American painters, others by the Dutch masters.  (Not up on my art history, would appreciate help here.)  If I scored this by what I see on my monitor, I''d be hard pressed to give it more than a 6 or 7.    But it is so strongly evokative of big, beautiful canvasses that I think I can push it up a little.  I doubt I''ll be voting with the crowd, but what''s new.', '2005-03-30 14:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
