(1259096, 160774, 33560, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is beautiful and the expressions are strong.  It appears to me that the subjects are a little unsharp.  I find the spaces at the left and right to be extraeneous  And I think I''d have cropped out the looming bar.  I''d also have rotated the photo so it was level, although it does feel more dynamic tilted.  I''d have liked it better if the shoulder of the one child did not block the face of the fourth.</td>', 'The lighting here is beautiful and the expressions are strong.  It appears to me that the subjects are a little unsharp.  I find the spaces at the left and right to be extraeneous  And I think I''d have cropped out the looming bar.  I''d also have rotated the photo so it was level, although it does feel more dynamic tilted.  I''d have liked it better if the shoulder of the one child did not block the face of the fourth.', '2005-03-30 14:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
