(1259480, 159607, 3087, '<td valign="top">In the beginning of Egyptian history there were cars? Whilst I appreciate that it''s not easy to find a viewpoint at a heavily visited monument like this that does not include signs of modern civilsation, this is far too blatant to really allow this image to work as a representation of early Egyptian history. PS this style of pyramid is not from the beginnings of the Egyptian civilisation anyway but someway through it''s long existence.</td>', 'In the beginning of Egyptian history there were cars? Whilst I appreciate that it''s not easy to find a viewpoint at a heavily visited monument like this that does not include signs of modern civilsation, this is far too blatant to really allow this image to work as a representation of early Egyptian history. PS this style of pyramid is not from the beginnings of the Egyptian civilisation anyway but someway through it''s long existence.', '2005-03-30 17:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
