(1259543, 159837, 19978, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great picture, but I''m not sure exactly what I''m looking at, and I''ve stared for quite some time now. My first hunch was some objects trapped in an amber-like substance, but I decided that''s not it. The objects look like embryos, which would be supported by the title, but where are they? What''s all the stuff around them?? I''m scoring a 6 in spite of my confusion - it''s an attractive, scientific-illustration-type picture.</td>', 'I think this is a great picture, but I''m not sure exactly what I''m looking at, and I''ve stared for quite some time now. My first hunch was some objects trapped in an amber-like substance, but I decided that''s not it. The objects look like embryos, which would be supported by the title, but where are they? What''s all the stuff around them?? I''m scoring a 6 in spite of my confusion - it''s an attractive, scientific-illustration-type picture.', '2005-03-30 17:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
