(1259644, 160643, 19978, '<td valign="top">I love the dark tones and overall dark feeling of the photo. I''m not sure about the legality since it looks like a selective desat, but I''m voting as if it''s a fair entry. Good sense of how to crop your subject. The pixelated background looks odd, like a shot in a cage?</td>', 'I love the dark tones and overall dark feeling of the photo. I''m not sure about the legality since it looks like a selective desat, but I''m voting as if it''s a fair entry. Good sense of how to crop your subject. The pixelated background looks odd, like a shot in a cage?', '2005-03-30 18:28:18.000000', NULL, 1);
