(1260109, 160931, 33542, '<td valign="top">Picture seems a bit crooked... if possible it might have been nice to use a narrower aperture here, too, to get all the flowers in focus at the same time.</td>', 'Picture seems a bit crooked... if possible it might have been nice to use a narrower aperture here, too, to get all the flowers in focus at the same time.', '2005-03-30 21:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
