(1260149, 161144, 33542, '<td valign="top">First of all, great expression on the two faces. Technically speaking, though, there''s some noise here, looks like maybe the result of increase in saturation. You might try playing with Neat Image (there''s a free trial) or a similar program if you don''t have one already. It''s a little bright for my tastes, too.</td>', 'First of all, great expression on the two faces. Technically speaking, though, there''s some noise here, looks like maybe the result of increase in saturation. You might try playing with Neat Image (there''s a free trial) or a similar program if you don''t have one already. It''s a little bright for my tastes, too.', '2005-03-30 21:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260154, 159085, 33542, '<td valign="top">I''m not a huge fan of the blue background color, and there''s a hot spot on the back metal thing (is that the lens? am I giving away my age  :)  I like the level of focus, though.</td>', 'I''m not a huge fan of the blue background color, and there''s a hot spot on the back metal thing (is that the lens? am I giving away my age  :)  I like the level of focus, though.', '2005-03-30 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260157, 161195, 33542, '<td valign="top">This is the best "bud" shot I''ve seen yet, however, I''d have preferred if you used a reflector at the bottom/left to get rid of the harsh variation b/w light and dark and also if you could have gotten rid of the shadow at the bottom.</td>', 'This is the best "bud" shot I''ve seen yet, however, I''d have preferred if you used a reflector at the bottom/left to get rid of the harsh variation b/w light and dark and also if you could have gotten rid of the shadow at the bottom.', '2005-03-30 21:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260163, 161174, 19978, '<td valign="top">I LOVE it! Where''d you get it?? Superb job, great concept. Shades of Gamow applied to biology and evolution. My favorite concept of the challenge so far!</td>', 'I LOVE it! Where''d you get it?? Superb job, great concept. Shades of Gamow applied to biology and evolution. My favorite concept of the challenge so far!', '2005-03-30 21:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
