(1260173, 161284, 33542, '<td valign="top">This image reminds me of a common debate... did Adam and Eve have belly buttons since they weren''t born? From a technical standpoint, there''s more grain in this than I generally like and the male hand seems to have something on his wrist. Also, I''d have preferred it be cropped the same distance from the two belly buttons, although I understand you did it to get the hands in the center (perhaps you could have moved the models a little).</td>', 'This image reminds me of a common debate... did Adam and Eve have belly buttons since they weren''t born? From a technical standpoint, there''s more grain in this than I generally like and the male hand seems to have something on his wrist. Also, I''d have preferred it be cropped the same distance from the two belly buttons, although I understand you did it to get the hands in the center (perhaps you could have moved the models a little).', '2005-03-30 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260180, 159745, 35530, '<td valign="top">Excellent. Sharp and well lit. The reflection really does it for me. I''m sure you will place very high. The only thing I see is 2 light areas going the length of both sides. Superb.</td>', 'Excellent. Sharp and well lit. The reflection really does it for me. I''m sure you will place very high. The only thing I see is 2 light areas going the length of both sides. Superb.', '2005-03-30 21:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
