(1260743, 161250, 35334, '<td valign="top">I started to give this a I, but then I looked at it more deeply and gave it a 6!</td>', 'I started to give this a I, but then I looked at it more deeply and gave it a 6!', '2005-03-30 23:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260745, 160306, 17837, '<td valign="top">2 rules broken here...<br/> <br/>1. Watch your horizon, it''s going on an upward slant. Make sure to check for level next time.<br/> <br/>2. The horizon is almost smack dab in the middle, and it really takes away from the image. <br/> <br/>I would have shifted the camera to look more to the right and get more of the land, and perhaps zoomed in a bit, that would eliminate the half/half photo.</td>', '2 rules broken here... 1. Watch your horizon, it''s going on an upward slant. Make sure to check for level next time. 2. The horizon is almost smack dab in the middle, and it really takes away from the image.  I would have shifted the camera to look more to the right and get more of the land, and perhaps zoomed in a bit, that would eliminate the half/half photo.', '2005-03-31 00:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260749, 161022, 34396, '<td valign="top">I think this photo really brings home the challenge.  It really conveys the feeling of new life after the water recedes from the barren rocks.  The colors are wonderful as well.  I think the border is just a bit to large and distracts from the photo, but I still really like it!  Adding to favorites.</td>', 'I think this photo really brings home the challenge.  It really conveys the feeling of new life after the water recedes from the barren rocks.  The colors are wonderful as well.  I think the border is just a bit to large and distracts from the photo, but I still really like it!  Adding to favorites.', '2005-03-31 00:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260751, 160822, 17837, '<td valign="top">This photo is a bit busy for me. I would have zoomed in and filled the frame with just the eagle, all the branches really take away from the photo, and paid extra attention to the exposure. You have no detail in both the shadows and highlights in the photo.<br/> <br/>Also, I dont believe this photo really captures the theme of the challenge.</td>', 'This photo is a bit busy for me. I would have zoomed in and filled the frame with just the eagle, all the branches really take away from the photo, and paid extra attention to the exposure. You have no detail in both the shadows and highlights in the photo. Also, I dont believe this photo really captures the theme of the challenge.', '2005-03-31 00:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260753, 161313, 17837, '<td valign="top">this photo lacks a subject and overall lacks a point of interest.</td>', 'this photo lacks a subject and overall lacks a point of interest.', '2005-03-31 00:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260754, 161088, 35334, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo</td>', 'Very nice photo', '2005-03-31 00:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
