(1260765, 159735, 17837, '<td valign="top">This is a great composition, however I would of liked to see more of the frog in focus.</td>', 'This is a great composition, however I would of liked to see more of the frog in focus.', '2005-03-31 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260774, 159474, 24454, '<td valign="top">What amazing timing for this challenge to allow you to submit a photo like this.  It''s beautiful!  I think I might have cropped it a little tighter, but that''s probably just one person''s taste and may not mean anything.   I''m giving it a 10 because I just love it.   Good luck!</td>', 'What amazing timing for this challenge to allow you to submit a photo like this.  It''s beautiful!  I think I might have cropped it a little tighter, but that''s probably just one person''s taste and may not mean anything.   I''m giving it a 10 because I just love it.   Good luck!', '2005-03-31 00:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1260776, 160823, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very pretty the way you captured the blue tones.   I love the contrast with the greens.  This is really a neat picture!</td>', 'Very pretty the way you captured the blue tones.   I love the contrast with the greens.  This is really a neat picture!', '2005-03-31 00:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
