(1261260, 161311, 32378, '<td valign="top">When i saw the thumbnail on this, I didn''t think I was going to like the picture at all.  However, I changed my mind as soon as I opened it.  Nice crisp colors, good detail, very well done.</td>', 'When i saw the thumbnail on this, I didn''t think I was going to like the picture at all.  However, I changed my mind as soon as I opened it.  Nice crisp colors, good detail, very well done.', '2005-03-31 09:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261263, 160571, 35044, '<td valign="top">Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though - more of an "end"! Hope that this is a specimen, not a victim.  shallow DoF, focus on a particular area of the skull and gentler lighting might have added some more depth.</td>', 'Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though - more of an "end"! Hope that this is a specimen, not a victim.  shallow DoF, focus on a particular area of the skull and gentler lighting might have added some more depth.', '2005-03-31 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
