(1261434, 161181, 35044, '<td valign="top">great scenery.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.  Love the rainbow.  Pipe in left foreground dsitracting. Also bird in top right (would have been netter if he had been flying into frame, not out of it)</td>', 'great scenery.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.  Love the rainbow.  Pipe in left foreground dsitracting. Also bird in top right (would have been netter if he had been flying into frame, not out of it)', '2005-03-31 10:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
