(1261436, 160827, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title (and I may not be clever enough to understand the tribute bit).  Details are blown in your centre of attention are in the middle of the pic - quite distracting.</td>', 'Nice sky.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title (and I may not be clever enough to understand the tribute bit).  Details are blown in your centre of attention are in the middle of the pic - quite distracting.', '2005-03-31 10:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261438, 160756, 29557, '<td valign="top">is the child that red? or color balance off?</td>', 'is the child that red? or color balance off?', '2005-03-31 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261440, 160943, 29557, '<td valign="top">just sporting off some new tricks?</td>', 'just sporting off some new tricks?', '2005-03-31 10:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261442, 161111, 29557, '<td valign="top">a lot of people dont have any idea what string theory is.. good luck on winning over the dpc crowd.</td>', 'a lot of people dont have any idea what string theory is.. good luck on winning over the dpc crowd.', '2005-03-31 10:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261444, 160943, 35044, '<td valign="top">there is a website of these somewhere!  Funny, but no beginning.  Too many underexposed areas in frame.</td>', 'there is a website of these somewhere!  Funny, but no beginning.  Too many underexposed areas in frame.', '2005-03-31 10:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261448, 159855, 35044, '<td valign="top">Noice pic.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title.  Some slight artefacting on the left bird?</td>', 'Noice pic.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title.  Some slight artefacting on the left bird?', '2005-03-31 10:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261450, 160878, 35044, '<td valign="top">V pretty image.  Focal point - tip of bud, very slightly overexposed (feels as though there is room in the histogram to move the levels down by a nothch or two, or underexpose slightly, and retain a bit more detail).</td>', 'V pretty image.  Focal point - tip of bud, very slightly overexposed (feels as though there is room in the histogram to move the levels down by a nothch or two, or underexpose slightly, and retain a bit more detail).', '2005-03-31 10:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261452, 159509, 35044, '<td valign="top">Wow! V dramatic, but very much a product of PS.  Slightly grainy as a consequence, but I think that adds to the effect.   Not sure how well this will score as a photograph, though.</td>', 'Wow! V dramatic, but very much a product of PS.  Slightly grainy as a consequence, but I think that adds to the effect.   Not sure how well this will score as a photograph, though.', '2005-03-31 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261454, 159993, 35044, '<td valign="top">Good representation of challenge. Composition works well, but you have bad artefacting in the red spot - overcompression?</td>', 'Good representation of challenge. Composition works well, but you have bad artefacting in the red spot - overcompression?', '2005-03-31 10:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261457, 160928, 35044, '<td valign="top">hey - for those of outside the US, that''s not even very old... let alone the beginning!  Lovely pic though, well composed.  Nice b&amp;w treatment.</td>', 'hey - for those of outside the US, that''s not even very old... let alone the beginning!  Lovely pic though, well composed.  Nice b&w treatment.', '2005-03-31 10:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261461, 161266, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract - cannot put my finger on it, buit seems a little artefacting, possibly a doube reflection or movement in your subject matter.  Like the striations, though.</td>', 'Nice abstract - cannot put my finger on it, buit seems a little artefacting, possibly a doube reflection or movement in your subject matter.  Like the striations, though.', '2005-03-31 10:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261464, 159575, 35044, '<td valign="top">Abstract and bold with it.  Nice, strong image.  Not very sharp opn the edge of the beams (though this may be intentional).  Abstrat element lost slightly below the bottom beam, where the shadow is affected by a reflection of light, it appears.</td>', 'Abstract and bold with it.  Nice, strong image.  Not very sharp opn the edge of the beams (though this may be intentional).  Abstrat element lost slightly below the bottom beam, where the shadow is affected by a reflection of light, it appears.', '2005-03-31 10:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261467, 161109, 35044, '<td valign="top">loevly strong fire image.  flame on the left is a little distracting as it is so bright in comparison, but overall very nice.</td>', 'loevly strong fire image.  flame on the left is a little distracting as it is so bright in comparison, but overall very nice.', '2005-03-31 10:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261469, 161075, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice pic - but that frame... really detracts due to its fussiness! sorry!</td>', 'Nice pic - but that frame... really detracts due to its fussiness! sorry!', '2005-03-31 10:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261470, 161246, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice colour and composition!  water is slightly "soft" Longish exposure? if so - not sure how that could be fixed.</td>', 'nice colour and composition!  water is slightly "soft" Longish exposure? if so - not sure how that could be fixed.', '2005-03-31 10:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261472, 161288, 35044, '<td valign="top">lots going on here pretty flowres.  low resolution probably does not fo image justice, as to get detail the sharpening is tough: looks a bit oversharpened (but I see that is probably important to get the detail).  Sky is a little over exposed - whole image could be a fraction darker on my screen.  If so, best done by underexposing the image in the camera to preserve sky detail.</td>', 'lots going on here pretty flowres.  low resolution probably does not fo image justice, as to get detail the sharpening is tough: looks a bit oversharpened (but I see that is probably important to get the detail).  Sky is a little over exposed - whole image could be a fraction darker on my screen.  If so, best done by underexposing the image in the camera to preserve sky detail.', '2005-03-31 10:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261473, 160956, 35044, '<td valign="top">good, simple symbolism.  nice lighting and the cropped focus point works for me.  Maybe could have lined the DoF on the edge of the bite with the stalk?</td>', 'good, simple symbolism.  nice lighting and the cropped focus point works for me.  Maybe could have lined the DoF on the edge of the bite with the stalk?', '2005-03-31 10:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261474, 159934, 35044, '<td valign="top">V Nice idea - hangs off title, but good photo.  giraffe looks fractionally soft, and some varied lighting might have imcreased the number of catchlights, giving greater depth to the toys.</td>', 'V Nice idea - hangs off title, but good photo.  giraffe looks fractionally soft, and some varied lighting might have imcreased the number of catchlights, giving greater depth to the toys.', '2005-03-31 10:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261475, 161090, 30049, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place - looks prone to flooding...  Nice photo too.  Only change I might have made is to crop out the top right corner of green.  Looks like a sidewalk or road that distracts the eye.</td>', 'Beautiful place - looks prone to flooding...  Nice photo too.  Only change I might have made is to crop out the top right corner of green.  Looks like a sidewalk or road that distracts the eye.', '2005-03-31 10:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261476, 159929, 35044, '<td valign="top">Maybe not enough "beginning" with or withou the title!  Great silhouette though - like the composition and bold contrast.</td>', 'Maybe not enough "beginning" with or withou the title!  Great silhouette though - like the composition and bold contrast.', '2005-03-31 10:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261478, 159505, 35044, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!  background very distracting.  lighting a bit flat - not much contrast in the image.</td>', 'Interesting idea!  background very distracting.  lighting a bit flat - not much contrast in the image.', '2005-03-31 10:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261479, 161267, 29256, '<td valign="top">Wonder how much mail page will get at the address shown?? Hope it was not the real address!</td>', 'Wonder how much mail page will get at the address shown?? Hope it was not the real address!', '2005-03-31 10:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261482, 160177, 35044, '<td valign="top">sky is a feature in this image but seems to be slightly over exposed.  but that stuff looks like something from a 50s monster movie - scary!</td>', 'sky is a feature in this image but seems to be slightly over exposed.  but that stuff looks like something from a 50s monster movie - scary!', '2005-03-31 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261485, 161287, 35044, '<td valign="top">love the colours and idea.  only thing I would change is composition as bud is very central here and stick on LHS is a little distracting (need more or less of it maybe)</td>', 'love the colours and idea.  only thing I would change is composition as bud is very central here and stick on LHS is a little distracting (need more or less of it maybe)', '2005-03-31 11:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261488, 160931, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice colours, well captured image.  Maybe lacking a little in composition as the left side seems heavier than the right, and the bars in the background a re a little distracting.</td>', 'nice colours, well captured image.  Maybe lacking a little in composition as the left side seems heavier than the right, and the bars in the background a re a little distracting.', '2005-03-31 11:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261489, 160858, 35044, '<td valign="top">ooh - good silence going on here.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.  Also, you ould make image bigger - you have 640 pixels to use and you are wasting them!</td>', 'ooh - good silence going on here.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.  Also, you ould make image bigger - you have 640 pixels to use and you are wasting them!', '2005-03-31 11:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261492, 161067, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Really want to see more of that pot - just too much out of frame (including the very bottom of the plant)  There is a slight yellow colour case on my monitor, too, than might be better removed, and the picture would benefit from a little sharpening, I think.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Really want to see more of that pot - just too much out of frame (including the very bottom of the plant)  There is a slight yellow colour case on my monitor, too, than might be better removed, and the picture would benefit from a little sharpening, I think.', '2005-03-31 11:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261493, 159643, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea - but you have lost too much detail in the highlights and increasing the saturation has made this very obvious.</td>', 'nice idea - but you have lost too much detail in the highlights and increasing the saturation has made this very obvious.', '2005-03-31 11:04:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261494, 161080, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice capture and arrangment of your models, but I really want to see a few pixels more at the bottom of the pic.</td>', 'nice capture and arrangment of your models, but I really want to see a few pixels more at the bottom of the pic.', '2005-03-31 11:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261495, 160274, 35044, '<td valign="top">beautiful image.  Maybe not enough "beginning" and I maybe missing something from your title.  Shame it is not advanced editing, as a bit more lightness &amp; detail in the sea only would improve this for me.</td>', 'beautiful image.  Maybe not enough "beginning" and I maybe missing something from your title.  Shame it is not advanced editing, as a bit more lightness & detail in the sea only would improve this for me.', '2005-03-31 11:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261496, 160111, 35044, '<td valign="top">I was waiting for one of these - good capture of a reasonably obvious idea! Simplicity is good, but some focal point onthe horizon might have been interesting.  Looks like you may have increased saturation to near the limits - maybe just loing some detail in the process in the waves.</td>', 'I was waiting for one of these - good capture of a reasonably obvious idea! Simplicity is good, but some focal point onthe horizon might have been interesting.  Looks like you may have increased saturation to near the limits - maybe just loing some detail in the process in the waves.', '2005-03-31 11:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261502, 159474, 29557, '<td valign="top">now that''s cute.</td>', 'now that''s cute.', '2005-03-31 11:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261504, 160170, 29557, '<td valign="top">haha, very cute</td>', 'haha, very cute', '2005-03-31 11:11:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261505, 161037, 35044, '<td valign="top">my gf refused to do this...  good job in getting the idea onto film (as such).  Slight lack of sharpness detracts and it looks as though there is a bit of noise in the image generally.  Maybe your ISO setting for a (presumably) indoor, curtains closed kind of shot.  Consider applying a bit of sharpening to the pic (remember to do this last).<br/> <br/>Compositionally, the apple might have been more interesting outside the centre of the frame.</td>', 'my gf refused to do this...  good job in getting the idea onto film (as such).  Slight lack of sharpness detracts and it looks as though there is a bit of noise in the image generally.  Maybe your ISO setting for a (presumably) indoor, curtains closed kind of shot.  Consider applying a bit of sharpening to the pic (remember to do this last). Compositionally, the apple might have been more interesting outside the centre of the frame.', '2005-03-31 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261506, 161073, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea.  Like the colour cast to the duotone. striking image - Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.</td>', 'nice idea.  Like the colour cast to the duotone. striking image - Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.', '2005-03-31 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261510, 161139, 35044, '<td valign="top">Yep - stressed look captrured nicely, though perhaps not the most flattering of poses for your model! Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.</td>', 'Yep - stressed look captrured nicely, though perhaps not the most flattering of poses for your model! Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, though.', '2005-03-31 11:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261511, 160321, 35044, '<td valign="top">Lovely image. like the slight "grain" in the b&amp;w style.  Rocks on side of waterfall maybe slightly strong for my taste.</td>', 'Lovely image. like the slight "grain" in the b&w style.  Rocks on side of waterfall maybe slightly strong for my taste.', '2005-03-31 11:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261515, 161273, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice buds shot.  caught at the right time.  Nice DoF to focus attention.  Maybe needs a tighter crop to increase level of interest in the photo?</td>', 'nice buds shot.  caught at the right time.  Nice DoF to focus attention.  Maybe needs a tighter crop to increase level of interest in the photo?', '2005-03-31 11:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261519, 160913, 35044, '<td valign="top">Yep - title down to a tea.  Personally find religious fever a bit much - the book mark maybe puts me over the edge very slightly on that front (though for many I am sure that will not be a problem).  red stain in book mark hole is slightly distracting.  Otherwise like the DoF and composition!</td>', 'Yep - title down to a tea.  Personally find religious fever a bit much - the book mark maybe puts me over the edge very slightly on that front (though for many I am sure that will not be a problem).  red stain in book mark hole is slightly distracting.  Otherwise like the DoF and composition!', '2005-03-31 11:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261528, 159530, 35044, '<td valign="top">This could be a really top noitch pic, but you will get criticised for the date stamp (heavily) and the distracting ephemera around the old man.  A tight crop around the man (perhaps with an image in which the socket is not sticking out of his head) adnI think that the lighting and subject matter would score highly.  Even with the bits of sticky tape, the light and interest in the subject is fantastic.  You are also not using all of your 640 pixel allowance... increase the size if you can.  <br/></td>', 'This could be a really top noitch pic, but you will get criticised for the date stamp (heavily) and the distracting ephemera around the old man.  A tight crop around the man (perhaps with an image in which the socket is not sticking out of his head) adnI think that the lighting and subject matter would score highly.  Even with the bits of sticky tape, the light and interest in the subject is fantastic.  You are also not using all of your 640 pixel allowance... increase the size if you can.  ', '2005-03-31 11:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261532, 160536, 35044, '<td valign="top">great capture.  couldn''t do it myself, but maybe a faster shutter speed would have kep tthe head in focus (though need to draw a line between than and the right amount of blur onthe wings).</td>', 'great capture.  couldn''t do it myself, but maybe a faster shutter speed would have kep tthe head in focus (though need to draw a line between than and the right amount of blur onthe wings).', '2005-03-31 11:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261536, 161321, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea - but I fear you may suffer from a backlash to the lightbulb style of photography...  Plus, there is lightl reflection greying out the top of the monitor, er aI mean backdrop.</td>', 'nice idea - but I fear you may suffer from a backlash to the lightbulb style of photography...  Plus, there is lightl reflection greying out the top of the monitor, er aI mean backdrop.', '2005-03-31 11:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261537, 161234, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice eviocative shot.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, but I like!</td>', 'nice eviocative shot.  Maybe not enough "beginning" without the title, but I like!', '2005-03-31 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261541, 161033, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - hue change may not be adding that much here, though, and sun area looks quite blown/undetailed for a major picture element.</td>', 'Nice composition - hue change may not be adding that much here, though, and sun area looks quite blown/undetailed for a major picture element.', '2005-03-31 11:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261545, 160356, 35044, '<td valign="top">loev the abstract plasma thing. hard to keep focus in low light on the plasma - you have done a good job.</td>', 'loev the abstract plasma thing. hard to keep focus in low light on the plasma - you have done a good job.', '2005-03-31 11:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261547, 160888, 35044, '<td valign="top">love the angle and DoF.  Light also great.  Overall - I like this a lot.</td>', 'love the angle and DoF.  Light also great.  Overall - I like this a lot.', '2005-03-31 11:26:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261550, 161173, 35044, '<td valign="top">far too dark on my monitor - all I see is vague outines and the lights.</td>', 'far too dark on my monitor - all I see is vague outines and the lights.', '2005-03-31 11:27:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261551, 161260, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, well executed. Apple looks v slightly soft to me.  Looks slightly bruised on side facing camera - no criticism of pic, just your prop! nice image.</td>', 'Nice idea, well executed. Apple looks v slightly soft to me.  Looks slightly bruised on side facing camera - no criticism of pic, just your prop! nice image.', '2005-03-31 11:28:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261552, 161289, 35044, '<td valign="top">Good use of frame filling - not sure about the bright red (is that a hue change) as that detracts slightly for me.  Also, is your picture the full 640 pixels?  If not, you are wasting some precious space for detail!</td>', 'Good use of frame filling - not sure about the bright red (is that a hue change) as that detracts slightly for me.  Also, is your picture the full 640 pixels?  If not, you are wasting some precious space for detail!', '2005-03-31 11:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261553, 161295, 35675, '<td valign="top">cool  8</td>', 'cool  8', '2005-03-31 11:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261556, 159906, 35675, '<td valign="top">7.5</td>', '7.5', '2005-03-31 11:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261558, 161213, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and good capture of the bird (eish he was flying into frame, not out of it).  Composition might have benefitted from rule of thirds being applied more stringently.  May be just me, but is horizon a pixel or two off straight, too (only an issue as it is a focus point).</td>', 'Nice colours and good capture of the bird (eish he was flying into frame, not out of it).  Composition might have benefitted from rule of thirds being applied more stringently.  May be just me, but is horizon a pixel or two off straight, too (only an issue as it is a focus point).', '2005-03-31 11:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261559, 160719, 34059, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, but it''s a pity that you can''t see the end of the wings... anyway a 7!</td>', 'very nice photo, but it''s a pity that you can''t see the end of the wings... anyway a 7!', '2005-03-31 11:32:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261561, 159517, 35044, '<td valign="top">contentious title - there was nothing, then light, not nothiong then darkness!  Image feels a bit blurry (slow exposure I know and coouds probably moving), while the moon is overexposed with no detail!  If you can, try taking underexposed pics of the moon and using PS to increase the brightness and contrast to retain detail.</td>', 'contentious title - there was nothing, then light, not nothiong then darkness!  Image feels a bit blurry (slow exposure I know and coouds probably moving), while the moon is overexposed with no detail!  If you can, try taking underexposed pics of the moon and using PS to increase the brightness and contrast to retain detail.', '2005-03-31 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261563, 161106, 35044, '<td valign="top">Dramatic!!  Border is too complicated for my taste.  colours are vobrant, but the lack of detail in the dark clouds a little distracting.  And it looks as thought there is a "grain" in the image that won''t serve you well (maybe consider using a different resizing program?) Nice image though.</td>', 'Dramatic!!  Border is too complicated for my taste.  colours are vobrant, but the lack of detail in the dark clouds a little distracting.  And it looks as thought there is a "grain" in the image that won''t serve you well (maybe consider using a different resizing program?) Nice image though.', '2005-03-31 11:35:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1261564, 160449, 35044, '<td valign="top">where did you get that title from...?  <br/> <br/>Image is a bit soft and looks a bit manufactured - though an excellent idea.  foireground blur is distracting.</td>', 'where did you get that title from...?   Image is a bit soft and looks a bit manufactured - though an excellent idea.  foireground blur is distracting.', '2005-03-31 11:36:30.000000', NULL, 1),
