(1262336, 161204, 22781, '<td valign="top">I dont know how many sunsets or sunrises I have seen in pictures and still they wow me still most of the time.<br/>Offcourse people will say that it is easy to make a sunset or sunrise look good because of all the nice colors that are just there (and that''s true)<br/>However, you managed to capture this very well, the sea is not underexposed, the reflections on the wet sand work very well.<br/>I rate pictures from 5-&gt;10 (never under 5) but you are a 10, dont mind what others say or think or vote, this is pretty and fits the challenge well.</td>', 'I dont know how many sunsets or sunrises I have seen in pictures and still they wow me still most of the time.Offcourse people will say that it is easy to make a sunset or sunrise look good because of all the nice colors that are just there (and that''s true)However, you managed to capture this very well, the sea is not underexposed, the reflections on the wet sand work very well.I rate pictures from 5->10 (never under 5) but you are a 10, dont mind what others say or think or vote, this is pretty and fits the challenge well.', '2005-03-31 18:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
