(1262528, 159953, 30018, '<td valign="top">Generally I have a rule...when an idea is repeated in a challenge, such as your idea of "genesis", I automatically take off at least on point from the score I give.  This time is the exception.  There are no better images in this challenge.  This is a great shot and it gets a great score from me.  Good luck, I think you have a winner here!  &lt;10&gt;</td>', 'Generally I have a rule...when an idea is repeated in a challenge, such as your idea of "genesis", I automatically take off at least on point from the score I give.  This time is the exception.  There are no better images in this challenge.  This is a great shot and it gets a great score from me.  Good luck, I think you have a winner here!  <10>', '2005-03-31 20:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
