(1262535, 159748, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very nice exposure, but just a little too busy for me.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Very nice exposure, but just a little too busy for me.  <6>', '2005-03-31 20:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262538, 159905, 19841, '<td valign="top">A little more artful arrangement of the items, and more interesting lighting would have improved this a lot.  It looks like you just staggered into the kitchen and took a snapshot using the flash attached to the camera. (I think it''s the worst invention in the history of photography)<br/>Morning coffee was  a good idea for the challenge.</td>', 'A little more artful arrangement of the items, and more interesting lighting would have improved this a lot.  It looks like you just staggered into the kitchen and took a snapshot using the flash attached to the camera. (I think it''s the worst invention in the history of photography)Morning coffee was  a good idea for the challenge.', '2005-03-31 20:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262541, 160171, 30018, '<td valign="top">looks like the machine I learned to type on.  &lt;LOL&gt;  Very nice image.  I love the wood tones that really warm the image up, and give it a nice feel.  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'looks like the machine I learned to type on.  <LOL>  Very nice image.  I love the wood tones that really warm the image up, and give it a nice feel.  <8>', '2005-03-31 20:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262548, 160928, 30018, '<td valign="top">I gotta tell  ya, I really wish there was an old steam engine in this image.  It is incredibly sharp, and the detial in the stone and slate shingles is beautiful, as well as the painted trim details...but we really need a train here!  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I gotta tell  ya, I really wish there was an old steam engine in this image.  It is incredibly sharp, and the detial in the stone and slate shingles is beautiful, as well as the painted trim details...but we really need a train here!  <8>', '2005-03-31 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262550, 159906, 30018, '<td valign="top">WOW!  Very nicely done   I can''t think of anything I would to do improve this image.  Great shot!  &lt;9&gt;</td>', 'WOW!  Very nicely done   I can''t think of anything I would to do improve this image.  Great shot!  <9>', '2005-03-31 20:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1262552, 160176, 19841, '<td valign="top">Another good idea flattened out by the flash attached to the camera.  Try disabling your flash, and take more pictures!</td>', 'Another good idea flattened out by the flash attached to the camera.  Try disabling your flash, and take more pictures!', '2005-03-31 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
