(1262564, 161037, 30018, '<td valign="top">Nice image, or at least nice idea.  I know it would have been tough, but this might have been a winner if taken outside amongst some trees rather than in a studio setting.  &lt;6&gt;</td>', 'Nice image, or at least nice idea.  I know it would have been tough, but this might have been a winner if taken outside amongst some trees rather than in a studio setting.  <6>', '2005-03-31 20:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
