(1262591, 161172, 30018, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this image strikes some people more strongly then it does me, because they have lived seeing this for the first time as they began a new life.  To me it''s a beautiful image, with great meaning, I honestly don''t truely understand, because I have lived in this great nation all my life.  Great idea, and original idea...that always is good for some extra credit.  Very nice image  &lt;8&gt;</td>', 'I''m sure this image strikes some people more strongly then it does me, because they have lived seeing this for the first time as they began a new life.  To me it''s a beautiful image, with great meaning, I honestly don''t truely understand, because I have lived in this great nation all my life.  Great idea, and original idea...that always is good for some extra credit.  Very nice image  <8>', '2005-03-31 21:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
