(1263572, 159530, 30959, '<td valign="top">I may totally misunderstand this, but your title seems to trivialize the plight of this man. This pictures begs his respect and the title seems to defy that. The time stamp further degrades a fantastic image. Were these meant to take away from an otherwise champion shot?</td>', 'I may totally misunderstand this, but your title seems to trivialize the plight of this man. This pictures begs his respect and the title seems to defy that. The time stamp further degrades a fantastic image. Were these meant to take away from an otherwise champion shot?', '2005-04-01 12:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
