(1263898, 160469, 34396, '<td valign="top">A nice photo, you can see the closeness between the boys.  The shot seems just a bit out of focus to me.</td>', 'A nice photo, you can see the closeness between the boys.  The shot seems just a bit out of focus to me.', '2005-04-01 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
