(1265056, 160931, 33947, '<td valign="top">Meets theme nicely. Good cropping.</td>', 'Meets theme nicely. Good cropping.', '2005-04-02 02:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265061, 161270, 33947, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting and detail. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting and detail. Nice job.', '2005-04-02 02:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265062, 161048, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting application of the challenge.  I like the look of the flipping pages.</td>', 'An interesting application of the challenge.  I like the look of the flipping pages.', '2005-04-02 02:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265086, 161204, 12356, '<td valign="top">Sweet shot.  Nice touch that you caught the bird in there too.</td>', 'Sweet shot.  Nice touch that you caught the bird in there too.', '2005-04-02 02:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265088, 161046, 33947, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this composition. Also, like how it''s cropped. Interesting lighting.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this composition. Also, like how it''s cropped. Interesting lighting.', '2005-04-02 02:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265098, 161104, 12356, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Nice detail, especially in the foreground ducklings (goslings?).   Really like this shot, expecially with the light color of the water behind their heads.</td>', 'Sweet!  Nice detail, especially in the foreground ducklings (goslings?).   Really like this shot, expecially with the light color of the water behind their heads.', '2005-04-02 02:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265105, 161195, 12356, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Nice lighting, great detail,  nice composition.</td>', 'Wow.  Nice lighting, great detail,  nice composition.', '2005-04-02 02:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265108, 161060, 12356, '<td valign="top">Great detail.</td>', 'Great detail.', '2005-04-02 02:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265109, 160483, 33947, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and cropping.</td>', 'Nice lighting and cropping.', '2005-04-02 02:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265120, 160776, 34396, '<td valign="top">I love the lighting in this picture.  The contrast is great and it really fits the challenge.  Good job!</td>', 'I love the lighting in this picture.  The contrast is great and it really fits the challenge.  Good job!', '2005-04-02 02:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265122, 160491, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very interesting lighting and textures in this shot.  I like it!</td>', 'Very interesting lighting and textures in this shot.  I like it!', '2005-04-02 02:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265133, 161060, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Excellent focus and lighting.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Excellent focus and lighting.', '2005-04-02 02:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265136, 161244, 34396, '<td valign="top">Man, now I need a glass of milk!  I like your creative angle on the challenge.  The lighting and focus are nice here!</td>', 'Man, now I need a glass of milk!  I like your creative angle on the challenge.  The lighting and focus are nice here!', '2005-04-02 02:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265140, 160670, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice clear focus.  I can''t tell for sure, but it looks like there are dead blooms at the top of this stalk.  I would have liked it a bit more without them.</td>', 'Nice clear focus.  I can''t tell for sure, but it looks like there are dead blooms at the top of this stalk.  I would have liked it a bit more without them.', '2005-04-02 02:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265144, 160962, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the smoothness of the sand and the overall contrast of the photo.  I couldn''t see the relationship to the challenge however.</td>', 'I like the smoothness of the sand and the overall contrast of the photo.  I couldn''t see the relationship to the challenge however.', '2005-04-02 02:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265148, 161304, 34396, '<td valign="top">Focus doesn''t seem sharp in this photo.  Flower seems to get lost in the shadows.</td>', 'Focus doesn''t seem sharp in this photo.  Flower seems to get lost in the shadows.', '2005-04-02 02:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265214, 160931, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flower buds.  I like the focus and colors here.</td>', 'Very pretty flower buds.  I like the focus and colors here.', '2005-04-02 03:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265231, 161033, 35495, '<td valign="top">This looks really eerie but is still a great photo<br/></td>', 'This looks really eerie but is still a great photo', '2005-04-02 03:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265267, 159583, 35495, '<td valign="top">I LOVE NINTENDO. You are right. Nintendo will go on forever!!!!!!! <br/>Full Marks for this shot!!!!!</td>', 'I LOVE NINTENDO. You are right. Nintendo will go on forever!!!!!!! Full Marks for this shot!!!!!', '2005-04-02 03:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265335, 161101, 19831, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Great colors and composition used effectively against negative space. Nice lighting and dof. Good use of leading lines and vanishing point. Very fitting for the challenge IMO on several levels. Great job.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Great colors and composition used effectively against negative space. Nice lighting and dof. Good use of leading lines and vanishing point. Very fitting for the challenge IMO on several levels. Great job.', '2005-04-02 03:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265350, 161321, 19831, '<td valign="top">Great concept. Composition is good. I think the bottom seems a wee too dark though, it seems like some detail is lost. I think just a little more light especially on the eggshell would make a much stronger photo.</td>', 'Great concept. Composition is good. I think the bottom seems a wee too dark though, it seems like some detail is lost. I think just a little more light especially on the eggshell would make a much stronger photo.', '2005-04-02 03:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265366, 161294, 19831, '<td valign="top">I like this concept a lot. The colors of the flower are great against the black background. I like the basic composition. I really like the use of negative space in a shot, but in this case it kind of seems like just a bit too much. I''m thinking that maybe a little closer in on the flower, making it larger(a little bit, not a lot), might give a much more balanced feel. I think it would be very much worth exploring further.  :-)</td>', 'I like this concept a lot. The colors of the flower are great against the black background. I like the basic composition. I really like the use of negative space in a shot, but in this case it kind of seems like just a bit too much. I''m thinking that maybe a little closer in on the flower, making it larger(a little bit, not a lot), might give a much more balanced feel. I think it would be very much worth exploring further.  :-)', '2005-04-02 03:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265387, 160176, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept that fits the challenge well IMO. Nice play of light and shadows. It  looks though like the model is just holding the apple up blocking out her lower face. I think an improvement could be to either actually show her mouth biting the apple, or perhaps held a little out and lower, showing part of the mouth as if she is about to bite. Just my 2 c.  :-)</td>', 'This is a good concept that fits the challenge well IMO. Nice play of light and shadows. It  looks though like the model is just holding the apple up blocking out her lower face. I think an improvement could be to either actually show her mouth biting the apple, or perhaps held a little out and lower, showing part of the mouth as if she is about to bite. Just my 2 c.  :-)', '2005-04-02 04:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265396, 160409, 19831, '<td valign="top">Your title tells the story, but I''m sorry, without it the photo doesn''t really say "''In the beginning" at all to me.  It kind of looks like a snapshot someone on vacation might take.</td>', 'Your title tells the story, but I''m sorry, without it the photo doesn''t really say "''In the beginning" at all to me.  It kind of looks like a snapshot someone on vacation might take.', '2005-04-02 04:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
