(1265978, 161109, 34396, '<td valign="top">Now this is the type of fire that I like to see.  You have captured both the base and the tip of the flame.  So many people concentrate just on the base, but there are so many subtleties in the tip.  Anyway, nice photo.  I like the lighting and the movement in the flames.  Good job!</td>', 'Now this is the type of fire that I like to see.  You have captured both the base and the tip of the flame.  So many people concentrate just on the base, but there are so many subtleties in the tip.  Anyway, nice photo.  I like the lighting and the movement in the flames.  Good job!', '2005-04-02 12:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1265980, 161295, 34396, '<td valign="top">Home brewed?  My guess from the levels in the bottles.  Nice take on the challenge!  This seems vaguely familar to me!  Very nice color through the glass.</td>', 'Home brewed?  My guess from the levels in the bottles.  Nice take on the challenge!  This seems vaguely familar to me!  Very nice color through the glass.', '2005-04-02 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
