(1266570, 161018, 29904, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I love fiber optic stuff.  Nice idea to put it on a red surface to off-set the blue.  Creative idea!</td>', 'Cool!  I love fiber optic stuff.  Nice idea to put it on a red surface to off-set the blue.  Creative idea!', '2005-04-02 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1266609, 161046, 20227, '<td valign="top">The composition of this photo is very clean. It really has a lot of appeal.</td>', 'The composition of this photo is very clean. It really has a lot of appeal.', '2005-04-02 20:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1266616, 160966, 29904, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I see the glory at the bottom, but the core does not look like an airplane profile.  Where did you take this from?  Just standing on a hill above a cloudbank?  I have a shot taken from a paraglider in Big Sur Ca.  I should post it.  Pumping up the contrast and saturation would bring out the color in the halo,   which I would love to see  and in higher resolution!  I think that would improove this shot over all too.  Still high score in my book :)</td>', 'Lovely!  I see the glory at the bottom, but the core does not look like an airplane profile.  Where did you take this from?  Just standing on a hill above a cloudbank?  I have a shot taken from a paraglider in Big Sur Ca.  I should post it.  Pumping up the contrast and saturation would bring out the color in the halo,   which I would love to see  and in higher resolution!  I think that would improove this shot over all too.  Still high score in my book :)', '2005-04-02 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
