(1267622, 161181, 34134, '<td valign="top">Overall nice picture. However it looks like it''s been "overly" processed and I don''t think the rocks in the forground look real. Also, I think it would have been more effective to move the main subject off center... maybe try and follow that bird. Great rainbow!<br/> <br/>Also, I''d have cropped out the light seaweed? in the lower left and the white flaw on the skyline on the left of the mountain.<br/></td>', 'Overall nice picture. However it looks like it''s been "overly" processed and I don''t think the rocks in the forground look real. Also, I think it would have been more effective to move the main subject off center... maybe try and follow that bird. Great rainbow! Also, I''d have cropped out the light seaweed? in the lower left and the white flaw on the skyline on the left of the mountain.', '2005-04-03 16:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
