(1267947, 160814, 12578, '<td valign="top">There may well be an actual focus but possibly due to resizing it seems to have lost any apparent crispness on the petals, the shot is very similar throughout and also lacks an overall focal point, great idea but had the above of come in and you had used a little less DOF to focus in on one point and blur the rest of the same things in the image this would be a fantastic shot. Good effort :0)</td>', 'There may well be an actual focus but possibly due to resizing it seems to have lost any apparent crispness on the petals, the shot is very similar throughout and also lacks an overall focal point, great idea but had the above of come in and you had used a little less DOF to focus in on one point and blur the rest of the same things in the image this would be a fantastic shot. Good effort :0)', '2005-04-03 20:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267950, 161285, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great angle and composition yet I feel you have gone over the top on the contrast as there is a very strong outline on top of the trees and the reflection in the puddle, also the yellows are going slightly day-glo green and my mind just wants them to be a vibrant yellow.</td>', 'Great angle and composition yet I feel you have gone over the top on the contrast as there is a very strong outline on top of the trees and the reflection in the puddle, also the yellows are going slightly day-glo green and my mind just wants them to be a vibrant yellow.', '2005-04-03 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267953, 161260, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting on the hand, but the apple is a little dark. It would be better if you left a little more room to the right, and top of the photo. The apple touching the top, and hand almost touching the side bothers me. Other than that, I like it very much, keep up the good work.</td>', 'I like the lighting on the hand, but the apple is a little dark. It would be better if you left a little more room to the right, and top of the photo. The apple touching the top, and hand almost touching the side bothers me. Other than that, I like it very much, keep up the good work.', '2005-04-03 20:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267956, 161302, 12578, '<td valign="top">love the border but feel that you could have gone with a single pixel line and a continution of the image to give it a great NEW effect, if unsure ho wI mean please contact me once the challenge finishes ( yeah I know thats quite picky but just saying what I feel ), and theres nout wrong with the shot BTW :0) good job 8</td>', 'love the border but feel that you could have gone with a single pixel line and a continution of the image to give it a great NEW effect, if unsure ho wI mean please contact me once the challenge finishes ( yeah I know thats quite picky but just saying what I feel ), and theres nout wrong with the shot BTW :0) good job 8', '2005-04-03 20:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267959, 161054, 15330, '<td valign="top">I like the way the neck curves, very interesting. This looks like it was tough to expose right, and it seems you got exposed it pretty well. I would try to lighten up the neck and head just a little (I understand you couldn''t do that in this challenge). The composition bothers me a little, the egg seems too centered.</td>', 'I like the way the neck curves, very interesting. This looks like it was tough to expose right, and it seems you got exposed it pretty well. I would try to lighten up the neck and head just a little (I understand you couldn''t do that in this challenge). The composition bothers me a little, the egg seems too centered.', '2005-04-03 20:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267965, 160306, 15330, '<td valign="top">This is a decent photograph, technically good. It would help if you included something in the foreground to give the photo some depth. I would also move the frame up just a little to show more of the sky, and improve composition a little. One last thing, you should always have one side meet the maximum 640 pixles.</td>', 'This is a decent photograph, technically good. It would help if you included something in the foreground to give the photo some depth. I would also move the frame up just a little to show more of the sky, and improve composition a little. One last thing, you should always have one side meet the maximum 640 pixles.', '2005-04-03 20:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267966, 160807, 12578, '<td valign="top">unfortunate to see alot of noise and an overall lack of focus</td>', 'unfortunate to see alot of noise and an overall lack of focus', '2005-04-03 20:26:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267968, 160822, 15330, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, tough for me to capture birds. It looks like the photo is  underexposed. The eagle is a little too centered, Moving the frame over to the left a liitle should improve composition.</td>', 'Nice shot, tough for me to capture birds. It looks like the photo is  underexposed. The eagle is a little too centered, Moving the frame over to the left a liitle should improve composition.', '2005-04-03 20:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1267976, 160943, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great shot but cant understand how this begins or the relevance? However to improve the shot I would prefer to see a better focus on the whole overall image by getting the whole shot in focus with better use of aperture and amending the colours of the LCD panel to diplay the exact same light emitting from the light on the wall as the monitor appears to be a few shades darker. Great concept, great idea, wrong challenge.</td>', 'Great shot but cant understand how this begins or the relevance? However to improve the shot I would prefer to see a better focus on the whole overall image by getting the whole shot in focus with better use of aperture and amending the colours of the LCD panel to diplay the exact same light emitting from the light on the wall as the monitor appears to be a few shades darker. Great concept, great idea, wrong challenge.', '2005-04-03 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
