(1268820, 159220, 35513, '<td valign="top">nice artsy shot.  I have no idea what it is...but I like it.</td>', 'nice artsy shot.  I have no idea what it is...but I like it.', '2005-04-04 01:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268882, 161213, 35411, '<td valign="top">I''m always frustrated by the large number of cliche pictures -- where people all seem to have the same idea. I guess it''s not the fault of the photographer, how would they know what others are going to do? It''s a very attractive image, nicely framed and the colors are right. <br/> <br/>My problem is more that there are a ton of other sea/beach/sun pictures in this contest. For me, it doesn''t speak very loudly about the topic.</td>', 'I''m always frustrated by the large number of cliche pictures -- where people all seem to have the same idea. I guess it''s not the fault of the photographer, how would they know what others are going to do? It''s a very attractive image, nicely framed and the colors are right.  My problem is more that there are a ton of other sea/beach/sun pictures in this contest. For me, it doesn''t speak very loudly about the topic.', '2005-04-04 02:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268891, 160671, 35411, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and great lines. I love the texture of the sand as well.</td>', 'Nice framing and great lines. I love the texture of the sand as well.', '2005-04-04 02:10:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268902, 160928, 35411, '<td valign="top">I think the title is the best part. Nice contrast ratio.</td>', 'I think the title is the best part. Nice contrast ratio.', '2005-04-04 02:13:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268914, 159642, 19831, '<td valign="top">A very good idea. Fits the challenge well IMO. I think however the background which seems very busy takes a lot away from the shot. Try simplifying things and isolate your subject more.  :-)</td>', 'A very good idea. Fits the challenge well IMO. I think however the background which seems very busy takes a lot away from the shot. Try simplifying things and isolate your subject more.  :-)', '2005-04-04 02:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1268916, 159294, 35411, '<td valign="top">The colors are great. So intense -- great image. The starkness of the white on the blood-orange sky. Wonderful. I wonder how you go the sky so orange and the lights so bright?</td>', 'The colors are great. So intense -- great image. The starkness of the white on the blood-orange sky. Wonderful. I wonder how you go the sky so orange and the lights so bright?', '2005-04-04 02:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
