(1269678, 160536, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a neat shot..Ilove how you can see the splash very well!  The bird is so pretty, and you can realy see the rippling in the water.</td>', 'This is a neat shot..Ilove how you can see the splash very well!  The bird is so pretty, and you can realy see the rippling in the water.', '2005-04-04 10:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
