(1269686, 160981, 32695, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful shot...I love the way the mountains are sitting there and just gorgeous...you can really see the texture and heighth of the mountains and then the picture just fades into the sky, which is so pretty,</td>', 'This is a beautiful shot...I love the way the mountains are sitting there and just gorgeous...you can really see the texture and heighth of the mountains and then the picture just fades into the sky, which is so pretty,', '2005-04-04 10:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
