(1270013, 159634, 7689, '<td valign="top">nice colors, composition and contrast...</td>', 'nice colors, composition and contrast...', '2005-04-04 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270018, 159700, 35044, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  Pushes a very religous angle on to this challenge.  Maybe intended to be funny (ie don''t press button, but instead trust jesus...!) - though this does not fully come out of the photo.  Maybe somehting with cars blurred in background going past would have got that  message across better.  Otherwise, image is slightly bland, lacking in strong visual interest.  Sticker remains on sign are distracting (something that could have been removed). Colours sightly muted.  Tenuous link to challenge.</td>', 'Interesting idea.  Pushes a very religous angle on to this challenge.  Maybe intended to be funny (ie don''t press button, but instead trust jesus...!) - though this does not fully come out of the photo.  Maybe somehting with cars blurred in background going past would have got that  message across better.  Otherwise, image is slightly bland, lacking in strong visual interest.  Sticker remains on sign are distracting (something that could have been removed). Colours sightly muted.  Tenuous link to challenge.', '2005-04-04 11:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270021, 160818, 35044, '<td valign="top">great idea!  Like the black surround.  However, lighting seems too bright for this scene - maybe a smaller aperture, underexposed picture, with contrast &amp; brightness tweaked in post-processing would have worked better?</td>', 'great idea!  Like the black surround.  However, lighting seems too bright for this scene - maybe a smaller aperture, underexposed picture, with contrast & brightness tweaked in post-processing would have worked better?', '2005-04-04 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270028, 160454, 35044, '<td valign="top">great image (that belly button piercing looks strained!).  amazingly smooth belly contrasts nicely with grass.  like the tight crop.  good choice if simple colours for model''s clothing.  Like.</td>', 'great image (that belly button piercing looks strained!).  amazingly smooth belly contrasts nicely with grass.  like the tight crop.  good choice if simple colours for model''s clothing.  Like.', '2005-04-04 12:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270033, 160842, 35044, '<td valign="top">Very clever image - technically brilliant. Slightly lacking in sharpness on numerals(focal lenght seems v short and focussed behind the glass and raised bezel).  Slightly tenuous connection to theme.</td>', 'Very clever image - technically brilliant. Slightly lacking in sharpness on numerals(focal lenght seems v short and focussed behind the glass and raised bezel).  Slightly tenuous connection to theme.', '2005-04-04 12:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270040, 161086, 35044, '<td valign="top">clever news-reportage capture and link!  Not many will get, I expect.  However, you will be criticised for blurriness and poor colour/contrast/brightness correction in post-processing.</td>', 'clever news-reportage capture and link!  Not many will get, I expect.  However, you will be criticised for blurriness and poor colour/contrast/brightness correction in post-processing.', '2005-04-04 12:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270045, 160773, 35044, '<td valign="top">good idea.  maybe need a little more in the image - maybe lose the jumper (reds look under-saturated on my monitor) and focus on a weak looking arm to capture theme.  several colours in triple shadow slightly distract (and slight graininess there).  Like the composition.</td>', 'good idea.  maybe need a little more in the image - maybe lose the jumper (reds look under-saturated on my monitor) and focus on a weak looking arm to capture theme.  several colours in triple shadow slightly distract (and slight graininess there).  Like the composition.', '2005-04-04 12:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270048, 159474, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great timing - on the dog''s part to arrive that week!  Flash lighting does little to add depth to the photo, and composition might have focussed tighter on pup.  Thanks for sharing sute pic, though!</td>', 'Great timing - on the dog''s part to arrive that week!  Flash lighting does little to add depth to the photo, and composition might have focussed tighter on pup.  Thanks for sharing sute pic, though!', '2005-04-04 12:08:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270056, 161284, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea, well executed.  Wonder if male model should have turned in a bit more to get belly buttons equally spaced from the sides.  wrist watch (?) on male model distracts.  Border is very thick - should be thinner if one at all.  More definition in the models'', or perhaps more moody lighting, might have provided more detail &amp; interest (not that I can compete on that front...!)</td>', 'nice idea, well executed.  Wonder if male model should have turned in a bit more to get belly buttons equally spaced from the sides.  wrist watch (?) on male model distracts.  Border is very thick - should be thinner if one at all.  More definition in the models'', or perhaps more moody lighting, might have provided more detail & interest (not that I can compete on that front...!)', '2005-04-04 12:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270058, 159953, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice image.  Liek the addition of the rosary.  while candle lighting is atmospheric, wonder whether a secondary source might have been used to get the book slightly brighter?  Goodfocus and detail.</td>', 'nice image.  Liek the addition of the rosary.  while candle lighting is atmospheric, wonder whether a secondary source might have been used to get the book slightly brighter?  Goodfocus and detail.', '2005-04-04 12:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270063, 160341, 35044, '<td valign="top">great capture! very cute.  photographically very challenging situiation - there is a strong colour cast (could be eliminated in PS) and a lot of grainiess (not so much a problem here, but could be removed with NeatImage too see if it would be improved without graininess).  Like the composition, except for the thing on the bottom left - which is indistinct and very dark.</td>', 'great capture! very cute.  photographically very challenging situiation - there is a strong colour cast (could be eliminated in PS) and a lot of grainiess (not so much a problem here, but could be removed with NeatImage too see if it would be improved without graininess).  Like the composition, except for the thing on the bottom left - which is indistinct and very dark.', '2005-04-04 12:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270066, 161306, 35044, '<td valign="top">You are not using your ful 640 pixels - picture is pixelated as a result.  Image is very hard to make out.sky looks a little overxposed.</td>', 'You are not using your ful 640 pixels - picture is pixelated as a result.  Image is very hard to make out.sky looks a little overxposed.', '2005-04-04 12:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270069, 161028, 35044, '<td valign="top">Very attractive photo.  like the lighting (slightly back lit?)  and the DoF separates fore, mid and background nicely.Very sharp. I like this.</td>', 'Very attractive photo.  like the lighting (slightly back lit?)  and the DoF separates fore, mid and background nicely.Very sharp. I like this.', '2005-04-04 12:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270074, 161155, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  However, technically suffering quite a lot.  Reflections in glass are very distracting (get closer to glass, consider polarising filter).  subject is out of focus and wires in background distract.frame on LHS adds nothing and should be cropped out.</td>', 'Nice idea.  However, technically suffering quite a lot.  Reflections in glass are very distracting (get closer to glass, consider polarising filter).  subject is out of focus and wires in background distract.frame on LHS adds nothing and should be cropped out.', '2005-04-04 12:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270076, 159663, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice colours, detail.  Green door itself a little dark. wire on RHS is distracting.  And cannot see any link to challenge.</td>', 'Nice colours, detail.  Green door itself a little dark. wire on RHS is distracting.  And cannot see any link to challenge.', '2005-04-04 12:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270082, 159653, 35044, '<td valign="top">Very pretty image.  Nice focus and detail.  Very light ovrexposure in catchlights in each drop of water detract from overall quality of image (because there are so manyof them!) and would like to have seen 5 more pixels at bottom (end of stamen cropped off) rather than the frame which is far too strong for such a light photo.</td>', 'Very pretty image.  Nice focus and detail.  Very light ovrexposure in catchlights in each drop of water detract from overall quality of image (because there are so manyof them!) and would like to have seen 5 more pixels at bottom (end of stamen cropped off) rather than the frame which is far too strong for such a light photo.', '2005-04-04 12:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270084, 161176, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  However, flower head is in shade, showing no contrast in flower head.  Colour is consequently muted and contrast low.  The focus seems a little off your central elements, but that may just need a bit of sharpening.</td>', 'Nice image.  However, flower head is in shade, showing no contrast in flower head.  Colour is consequently muted and contrast low.  The focus seems a little off your central elements, but that may just need a bit of sharpening.', '2005-04-04 12:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270087, 160718, 35044, '<td valign="top">love the idea!  bold lines.  Lighting perhaps making the image slightly flat (flash?).  might have been better if top-lit.  Also, very little texture in background - only texture interferes with finger area, where it distracts slightly.</td>', 'love the idea!  bold lines.  Lighting perhaps making the image slightly flat (flash?).  might have been better if top-lit.  Also, very little texture in background - only texture interferes with finger area, where it distracts slightly.', '2005-04-04 12:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270091, 160784, 35044, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Just not sure if this image carries it off.  Great colours and detail in the woman, but the unfocussed man could be interpreted in so many ways, and so dominates the picture that the image looks a little unbalanced.  Bit more space between the two would have been better, I think.</td>', 'Great idea.  Just not sure if this image carries it off.  Great colours and detail in the woman, but the unfocussed man could be interpreted in so many ways, and so dominates the picture that the image looks a little unbalanced.  Bit more space between the two would have been better, I think.', '2005-04-04 12:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270095, 161195, 35044, '<td valign="top">gorgeous image - great detail.  Wish that there was fractrionally more light on the stalk to the bud.  good bokeh.  Wonder if coimpositionally might have benefited from losing a bit on the right?</td>', 'gorgeous image - great detail.  Wish that there was fractrionally more light on the stalk to the bud.  good bokeh.  Wonder if coimpositionally might have benefited from losing a bit on the right?', '2005-04-04 12:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
