(1270164, 160887, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea well executed.  focus, DoF, colour all fine.  Image does not have the "x" factor to push it past a "nice" image, though- subject is hard to photograph with strong expression.</td>', 'Nice idea well executed.  focus, DoF, colour all fine.  Image does not have the "x" factor to push it past a "nice" image, though- subject is hard to photograph with strong expression.', '2005-04-04 12:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270166, 159938, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice image.  Good colours and detail.  DoF drops off slightly too fast for my taste.  Top right is a little plain, and RHS feels a little empty.</td>', 'nice image.  Good colours and detail.  DoF drops off slightly too fast for my taste.  Top right is a little plain, and RHS feels a little empty.', '2005-04-04 12:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270173, 160356, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, beautiful colors.</td>', 'Nice capture, beautiful colors.', '2005-04-04 13:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270193, 159752, 35044, '<td valign="top">Good idea - nearly did something similar myself.  Like the use of b&amp;w.  DoF slightly blurs the playing pieces.  Maybe a clearer focus on the word "Go" would have been good.  Also (to be really picky) I would have placed the die so that 5 and 1 did not appear on the faces facing the camera for both.  And the background is a little empty - coud you have had the remainder of the board as th backdrop (though query whther that would have been cludttered)?</td>', 'Good idea - nearly did something similar myself.  Like the use of b&w.  DoF slightly blurs the playing pieces.  Maybe a clearer focus on the word "Go" would have been good.  Also (to be really picky) I would have placed the die so that 5 and 1 did not appear on the faces facing the camera for both.  And the background is a little empty - coud you have had the remainder of the board as th backdrop (though query whther that would have been cludttered)?', '2005-04-04 13:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270195, 160585, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Almost duotone - interesting!  hedge does little to provide foreground interest for me, however (sorry).  Idea is not particularly innovative for the challenge.</td>', 'Nice sky.  Almost duotone - interesting!  hedge does little to provide foreground interest for me, however (sorry).  Idea is not particularly innovative for the challenge.', '2005-04-04 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270198, 161320, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up shot.  I think the colors are a little off and the lighting could be a bit brighter.  Wonderful look on childs'' face.</td>', 'Nice close-up shot.  I think the colors are a little off and the lighting could be a bit brighter.  Wonderful look on childs'' face.', '2005-04-04 13:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270200, 159791, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice image - very interesting angle.  pretty model. Lots of black/white contrast.  annot decide if white underwear on side detracts.  corner above couch distracts slightly. Link to challenge a bit tenuous (relies on title).</td>', 'Nice image - very interesting angle.  pretty model. Lots of black/white contrast.  annot decide if white underwear on side detracts.  corner above couch distracts slightly. Link to challenge a bit tenuous (relies on title).', '2005-04-04 13:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270206, 161078, 35044, '<td valign="top">nice idea!  Good prop.  Your backdrop is very distracting, however - really needs to be smooth, or intentionally ruffled.  Comes across here as just being unironed!  Could get nice bokeh and blur the background by moving prop forwards and using smaller Av number.  Could do with a touch more detail in the balcks (overexposure would help obscure background too) and a bit more sharpness would help.</td>', 'nice idea!  Good prop.  Your backdrop is very distracting, however - really needs to be smooth, or intentionally ruffled.  Comes across here as just being unironed!  Could get nice bokeh and blur the background by moving prop forwards and using smaller Av number.  Could do with a touch more detail in the balcks (overexposure would help obscure background too) and a bit more sharpness would help.', '2005-04-04 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270207, 161109, 2170, '<td valign="top">i''m not sure how this represents the beginning of anything.  nice shot, though.</td>', 'i''m not sure how this represents the beginning of anything.  nice shot, though.', '2005-04-04 13:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270208, 161035, 2170, '<td valign="top">i wish this was sharper</td>', 'i wish this was sharper', '2005-04-04 13:18:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270209, 161267, 2170, '<td valign="top">great point of view here</td>', 'great point of view here', '2005-04-04 13:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270211, 159085, 35044, '<td valign="top">Like this idea.  Coposition eexcellent.  Backgroundcolour complements nicely.  Very slight softness on foreground camera face.  camera is facing out of frame, though I like that here.  Interesting, but not enough "x" factor to get to highest rating for me.</td>', 'Like this idea.  Coposition eexcellent.  Backgroundcolour complements nicely.  Very slight softness on foreground camera face.  camera is facing out of frame, though I like that here.  Interesting, but not enough "x" factor to get to highest rating for me.', '2005-04-04 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270213, 160928, 2170, '<td valign="top">without the title, this doesn''t reflect the challenge at all</td>', 'without the title, this doesn''t reflect the challenge at all', '2005-04-04 13:19:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270217, 161204, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice image, great colourm nice sky and contrast with sea and sand.  Missing a focal point, for me.Maybe too much contrast between sky and sea - not enough colour picked up in sea, leaving a slight unnatural look (though this may have been the case in reality), possibly caused by over-saturation.</td>', 'Nice image, great colourm nice sky and contrast with sea and sand.  Missing a focal point, for me.Maybe too much contrast between sky and sea - not enough colour picked up in sea, leaving a slight unnatural look (though this may have been the case in reality), possibly caused by over-saturation.', '2005-04-04 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270220, 161048, 2170, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but aren''t there only 5 lines in each row of sheet music?</td>', 'nice idea, but aren''t there only 5 lines in each row of sheet music?', '2005-04-04 13:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270223, 161244, 2170, '<td valign="top">this is a great interpretation of the challenge.  thank god it''s not another picture of the sky.</td>', 'this is a great interpretation of the challenge.  thank god it''s not another picture of the sky.', '2005-04-04 13:24:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270226, 160750, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think that once an egg has been hard-boiled it''s pretty much the end instead of the beginning.</td>', 'i think that once an egg has been hard-boiled it''s pretty much the end instead of the beginning.', '2005-04-04 13:24:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270232, 161149, 2170, '<td valign="top">great interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'great interpretation of the challenge.', '2005-04-04 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270235, 160823, 2170, '<td valign="top">lovely shot.  i don''t think it applies for this challenge, though.</td>', 'lovely shot.  i don''t think it applies for this challenge, though.', '2005-04-04 13:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270236, 161088, 2170, '<td valign="top">a wonderful interpretation of the challenge, and a damn fine shot to boot.</td>', 'a wonderful interpretation of the challenge, and a damn fine shot to boot.', '2005-04-04 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270241, 160938, 2170, '<td valign="top">this technique is pretty overdone on this site, and the glasses don''t enhance the shot here at all -- they just get in the way.</td>', 'this technique is pretty overdone on this site, and the glasses don''t enhance the shot here at all -- they just get in the way.', '2005-04-04 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270242, 160820, 2170, '<td valign="top">great shot.  not sure how it fits the challenge, but a wonderful profile.</td>', 'great shot.  not sure how it fits the challenge, but a wonderful profile.', '2005-04-04 13:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270246, 160756, 2170, '<td valign="top">is there a reason she is completely red?</td>', 'is there a reason she is completely red?', '2005-04-04 13:30:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270247, 159944, 2170, '<td valign="top">this shot is far too blurry.</td>', 'this shot is far too blurry.', '2005-04-04 13:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270250, 160888, 2170, '<td valign="top">i would like to see a little bit more light to make the subject pop, but this is a good composition</td>', 'i would like to see a little bit more light to make the subject pop, but this is a good composition', '2005-04-04 13:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270350, 160306, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice clear photo.  However, lacking in drama - sky looks a bit faded, sea quite calm.  Wonder if a panoramic, letter box style would help the composition?  Link to challenge is entirely in the title.</td>', 'Nice clear photo.  However, lacking in drama - sky looks a bit faded, sea quite calm.  Wonder if a panoramic, letter box style would help the composition?  Link to challenge is entirely in the title.', '2005-04-04 14:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270362, 161184, 34396, '<td valign="top">An interesting take on the challenge.  I think this photo could have looked better with more contrast and less grain.  It just looks faded to me.</td>', 'An interesting take on the challenge.  I think this photo could have looked better with more contrast and less grain.  It just looks faded to me.', '2005-04-04 14:19:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270371, 161066, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  I like how the clouds and trees both look like they are being blown to the right by the wind.  Contrast is pretty good.  The skyline to the left has a bit too much glare for me.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  I like how the clouds and trees both look like they are being blown to the right by the wind.  Contrast is pretty good.  The skyline to the left has a bit too much glare for me.', '2005-04-04 14:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270374, 160559, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in this photo.  The clouds look out of focus.</td>', 'I like the contrast in this photo.  The clouds look out of focus.', '2005-04-04 14:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270377, 161147, 35044, '<td valign="top">great capture! looks as though someone is about to be impaled on a twig!  Only issue here is the seriously weak link to the challenge (though I am sure you know that.)</td>', 'great capture! looks as though someone is about to be impaled on a twig!  Only issue here is the seriously weak link to the challenge (though I am sure you know that.)', '2005-04-04 14:25:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1270379, 161222, 34396, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell exactly what you are trying to show with this picture.  From the title, I can tell it is grass, but there are too many other distraction in the photo.  I think you could have cropped the entire top of the photo to leave just snow and grass and it would have had more impact.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell exactly what you are trying to show with this picture.  From the title, I can tell it is grass, but there are too many other distraction in the photo.  I think you could have cropped the entire top of the photo to leave just snow and grass and it would have had more impact.', '2005-04-04 14:26:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270383, 160559, 35044, '<td valign="top">Nice idea (though many others have had the same.  Sadly, lots of blurring here and so much contrast that there is no detail to comment on.</td>', 'Nice idea (though many others have had the same.  Sadly, lots of blurring here and so much contrast that there is no detail to comment on.', '2005-04-04 14:29:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270391, 161088, 35044, '<td valign="top">Very powerful image.  Love the composition, and parituclarly the lighting.  Manages to capture a sense of beginning that a thousand "light" shots could never do.</td>', 'Very powerful image.  Love the composition, and parituclarly the lighting.  Manages to capture a sense of beginning that a thousand "light" shots could never do.', '2005-04-04 14:32:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270401, 161268, 34396, '<td valign="top">Lighting on subject is good.  I think the background is too bright, especially on the left hand side.  If I cover it with my hand, much more detail from the subjects face is visible.</td>', 'Lighting on subject is good.  I think the background is too bright, especially on the left hand side.  If I cover it with my hand, much more detail from the subjects face is visible.', '2005-04-04 14:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270407, 161070, 34396, '<td valign="top">The shot is nice, I just don''t care for the redish purple of the clouds.</td>', 'The shot is nice, I just don''t care for the redish purple of the clouds.', '2005-04-04 14:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270415, 161080, 34396, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot.  I think if you had just shot the sprout on the left I would have given you a higher score.  The withering, dead sprout on the right takes away from the crispness of the one on the left.  Otherwise, lighting is good and focus is dead on!</td>', 'Not a bad shot.  I think if you had just shot the sprout on the left I would have given you a higher score.  The withering, dead sprout on the right takes away from the crispness of the one on the left.  Otherwise, lighting is good and focus is dead on!', '2005-04-04 14:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270424, 160751, 34396, '<td valign="top">Beginning of a good game...  This is a nice shot.  Lighting and focus are good.  I don''t care for the upper left corner of the backdrop.  It starts to change colors.  There are also some spots in the background on the right side.  If the background had been all black, I would have bumped it a point or two.</td>', 'Beginning of a good game...  This is a nice shot.  Lighting and focus are good.  I don''t care for the upper left corner of the backdrop.  It starts to change colors.  There are also some spots in the background on the right side.  If the background had been all black, I would have bumped it a point or two.', '2005-04-04 14:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270432, 160865, 34396, '<td valign="top">The bird is slightly out of focus and too small in the frame.  I''m also having trouble linking this to the challenge of "In the Beginning".</td>', 'The bird is slightly out of focus and too small in the frame.  I''m also having trouble linking this to the challenge of "In the Beginning".', '2005-04-04 14:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270441, 160171, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and composition of this shot.  Focus is much too soft.  If it were in better focus, I would have bumped it up a few notches.</td>', 'I like the idea and composition of this shot.  Focus is much too soft.  If it were in better focus, I would have bumped it up a few notches.', '2005-04-04 14:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270445, 160449, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice job.  I like the candling of the egg.  Haven''t seen this from anyone else.  Focus seems just a bit soft on the egg.</td>', 'Nice job.  I like the candling of the egg.  Haven''t seen this from anyone else.  Focus seems just a bit soft on the egg.', '2005-04-04 14:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270446, 160372, 31005, '<td valign="top">now that is being at the right place at the right time.</td>', 'now that is being at the right place at the right time.', '2005-04-04 14:48:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270449, 161054, 31005, '<td valign="top">how beautiful</td>', 'how beautiful', '2005-04-04 14:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270451, 161193, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the textures on the surface of the water.  I think this would have looked better if the buildings/boats? were cropped from the left side of frame.  or just crop the entire top of frame.</td>', 'I like the textures on the surface of the water.  I think this would have looked better if the buildings/boats? were cropped from the left side of frame.  or just crop the entire top of frame.', '2005-04-04 14:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270459, 160836, 34396, '<td valign="top">Beginning of dinner...  Good idea!  I like the shot, colors look a bit faded to me.  Good lighting.</td>', 'Beginning of dinner...  Good idea!  I like the shot, colors look a bit faded to me.  Good lighting.', '2005-04-04 14:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270461, 159607, 31005, '<td valign="top">I think the car and the person take away from the picture.  I would have cropped them out.  Hindsight isn''t always on my side.</td>', 'I think the car and the person take away from the picture.  I would have cropped them out.  Hindsight isn''t always on my side.', '2005-04-04 14:53:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270465, 160281, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the pose of the duck and the framing.  The picture could use a bit more contrast?  Colors seem a bit washed out.</td>', 'I like the pose of the duck and the framing.  The picture could use a bit more contrast?  Colors seem a bit washed out.', '2005-04-04 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270466, 161036, 31005, '<td valign="top">a little to graining for me.  But still a pretty view.</td>', 'a little to graining for me.  But still a pretty view.', '2005-04-04 14:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270467, 161195, 31005, '<td valign="top">love the texture on the bloom.</td>', 'love the texture on the bloom.', '2005-04-04 14:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270468, 160375, 34396, '<td valign="top">Although it doesn''t look much like ooze to me, I do like the outline of the ice against the grass.  The colors are nice and the focus is verg good.</td>', 'Although it doesn''t look much like ooze to me, I do like the outline of the ice against the grass.  The colors are nice and the focus is verg good.', '2005-04-04 14:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270474, 159993, 34396, '<td valign="top">Good idea for challenge.    I think lighting could have been a little better, and focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Good idea for challenge.    I think lighting could have been a little better, and focus is a bit soft.', '2005-04-04 14:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270477, 160719, 31005, '<td valign="top">great color</td>', 'great color', '2005-04-04 14:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270479, 159241, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I think the lighting on the baby is good.  The eyes are just incredible!  I think the change in background colors is a bit distracting, I see at least 3 different colors between the foreground left, foreground right and background.  Otherwise a great shot!</td>', 'Very cute!  I think the lighting on the baby is good.  The eyes are just incredible!  I think the change in background colors is a bit distracting, I see at least 3 different colors between the foreground left, foreground right and background.  Otherwise a great shot!', '2005-04-04 14:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270480, 159474, 31005, '<td valign="top">awww</td>', 'awww', '2005-04-04 14:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270482, 160866, 31005, '<td valign="top">great color</td>', 'great color', '2005-04-04 15:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270483, 159905, 31005, '<td valign="top">I always think of my coffee when I think of beginnings.</td>', 'I always think of my coffee when I think of beginnings.', '2005-04-04 15:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270484, 160732, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Fitting for the challenge.  I don''t care for the pose of the baby.  I think this would look better if a foot was visible.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Fitting for the challenge.  I don''t care for the pose of the baby.  I think this would look better if a foot was visible.', '2005-04-04 15:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270485, 159307, 34396, '<td valign="top">I like the color in the buds.  I wish the buds had been a bit larger since they are the subject here.  The blurred leaves dominate the picture and pull your eye away from the buds.</td>', 'I like the color in the buds.  I wish the buds had been a bit larger since they are the subject here.  The blurred leaves dominate the picture and pull your eye away from the buds.', '2005-04-04 15:02:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270493, 161270, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  The color is great and focus on the stamens is good.  Good job!</td>', 'Very cool shot!  The color is great and focus on the stamens is good.  Good job!', '2005-04-04 15:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270497, 161149, 34396, '<td valign="top">That must be the coarse grind!  I think this was a fitting call to the challenge of in the beginning.  The colors and focus are very good.  I don''t care too much for the mixing of the beans and grounds.  I would like to see this with the beans and ground coffee side by side.  Touching, but separate.  8</td>', 'That must be the coarse grind!  I think this was a fitting call to the challenge of in the beginning.  The colors and focus are very good.  I don''t care too much for the mixing of the beans and grounds.  I would like to see this with the beans and ground coffee side by side.  Touching, but separate.  8', '2005-04-04 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270501, 160449, 24168, '<td valign="top">very good idea.</td>', 'very good idea.', '2005-04-04 15:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270502, 160756, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of emotion.  Good focus on the eyes.  The colors are just a bit too red for me and I don''t care for the cropping, too much off the top.</td>', 'Nice capture of emotion.  Good focus on the eyes.  The colors are just a bit too red for me and I don''t care for the cropping, too much off the top.', '2005-04-04 15:10:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270504, 160625, 32338, '<td valign="top">Nice, except for the right edge.</td>', 'Nice, except for the right edge.', '2005-04-04 15:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270505, 161294, 24168, '<td valign="top">perfect choice of flower. very nice.</td>', 'perfect choice of flower. very nice.', '2005-04-04 15:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270507, 159944, 34396, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve been here before!  Good shot, The color of the mountains in the background seem to be faded a bit.  Don''t know if a little more saturation or contrast would have helped.  Overall, I like it.</td>', 'I think I''ve been here before!  Good shot, The color of the mountains in the background seem to be faded a bit.  Don''t know if a little more saturation or contrast would have helped.  Overall, I like it.', '2005-04-04 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270508, 161310, 33732, '<td valign="top">I like this idea.  Of course I think the life cycle is appropriate for the assignment.</td>', 'I like this idea.  Of course I think the life cycle is appropriate for the assignment.', '2005-04-04 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270510, 160372, 34396, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture.  I like the intensity of the stare.  The brush on the right almost seems to form a spider web and the fox? is well framed between it and the trees.  Good job!</td>', 'Very nice capture.  I like the intensity of the stare.  The brush on the right almost seems to form a spider web and the fox? is well framed between it and the trees.  Good job!', '2005-04-04 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270514, 161260, 34396, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  I think the lighting is very good.  The apple appears a bit too dull.  Maybe a polish would have improved it.</td>', 'Good shot.  I think the lighting is very good.  The apple appears a bit too dull.  Maybe a polish would have improved it.', '2005-04-04 15:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270516, 160585, 33732, '<td valign="top">I was going to submit light.  This is a good one.  If light was first, shrubs came later.</td>', 'I was going to submit light.  This is a good one.  If light was first, shrubs came later.', '2005-04-04 15:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270520, 161309, 34396, '<td valign="top">Beginning of a work of art.  I like the concept.  I think the bottle are a bit too out of focus.  Maybe a more flowing stroke of paint on the canvas would have been nice as well.</td>', 'Beginning of a work of art.  I like the concept.  I think the bottle are a bit too out of focus.  Maybe a more flowing stroke of paint on the canvas would have been nice as well.', '2005-04-04 15:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270521, 159944, 33732, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2005-04-04 15:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270522, 160104, 34396, '<td valign="top">Wow, brilliant colors.  What are those?  Focus and lighting are good.  Nice job.</td>', 'Wow, brilliant colors.  What are those?  Focus and lighting are good.  Nice job.', '2005-04-04 15:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270523, 161313, 33732, '<td valign="top">This would have been great wth water in the foreground.  I like the colors.</td>', 'This would have been great wth water in the foreground.  I like the colors.', '2005-04-04 15:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270526, 161061, 33732, '<td valign="top">What color was the sky?</td>', 'What color was the sky?', '2005-04-04 15:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270528, 161119, 34396, '<td valign="top">Nice simple shot.  Uncluttered.  I like the balance here.  The color of the sky seems a bit too turquoise to me.  I would have cropped the right to remove the clouds.  7</td>', 'Nice simple shot.  Uncluttered.  I like the balance here.  The color of the sky seems a bit too turquoise to me.  I would have cropped the right to remove the clouds.  7', '2005-04-04 15:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270537, 160938, 33732, '<td valign="top">Very good message.  How could you have placed a sunny sky above this page?</td>', 'Very good message.  How could you have placed a sunny sky above this page?', '2005-04-04 15:22:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270540, 161261, 3569, '<td valign="top">I tried a one handed effort of yours, yours works, mine appears to not have.  Good luck.</td>', 'I tried a one handed effort of yours, yours works, mine appears to not have.  Good luck.', '2005-04-04 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1270543, 159525, 346, '<td valign="top">Amazing contrasts in this shot. Love it!</td>', 'Amazing contrasts in this shot. Love it!', '2005-04-04 15:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
