(1271044, 161086, 33947, '<td valign="top">Too dark and blurry. Comes off as a quick snapshot that makes you strain to look at it. Good concept, though.</td>', 'Too dark and blurry. Comes off as a quick snapshot that makes you strain to look at it. Good concept, though.', '2005-04-04 20:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
