(1271128, 159905, 33947, '<td valign="top">Love your idea, but the composition went a little flat. Several separate areas of interest. Maybe zooming in on the coffee pot would simplify the photo and bring full focus to the star!! :)</td>', 'Love your idea, but the composition went a little flat. Several separate areas of interest. Maybe zooming in on the coffee pot would simplify the photo and bring full focus to the star!! :)', '2005-04-04 21:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
