(1271419, 159790, 33947, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of the photo, and the highlights on the apple, but the yellowish background on the left side is distracting. I like the starkness of the white on the right. Good idea.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of the photo, and the highlights on the apple, but the yellowish background on the left side is distracting. I like the starkness of the white on the right. Good idea.', '2005-04-04 23:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
