(1271763, 160943, 9668, '<td valign="top">Ah! Took me a little bit to realize that you are saying that it is the beginning of transparent laptop screens. Your color yellow-orange from the lamp backgrounnds is off a little bit, making the screen seems like a filter rather then transparent, which kindof messes up the concept a little bit. But cool idea, hope other people catch it too.</td>', 'Ah! Took me a little bit to realize that you are saying that it is the beginning of transparent laptop screens. Your color yellow-orange from the lamp backgrounnds is off a little bit, making the screen seems like a filter rather then transparent, which kindof messes up the concept a little bit. But cool idea, hope other people catch it too.', '2005-04-05 03:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
