(1272133, 161125, 30049, '<td valign="top">This subject has so much potential.  The composition of this looks like a tourist snapshot.  If this is something near to you revisit when better lighting is available, dusk or dawn, and try some various angles (non centered as it currently is).  If the sky isn''t interesting try not to show it.  I can envision a shot of this tighter in with the sun casting a shadow in the door frame?  Very cool subject - I''m jealous.  Keep having fun!</td>', 'This subject has so much potential.  The composition of this looks like a tourist snapshot.  If this is something near to you revisit when better lighting is available, dusk or dawn, and try some various angles (non centered as it currently is).  If the sky isn''t interesting try not to show it.  I can envision a shot of this tighter in with the sun casting a shadow in the door frame?  Very cool subject - I''m jealous.  Keep having fun!', '2005-04-05 09:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
