(1272456, 161049, 30049, '<td valign="top">Ok...I know I''ve seen this statue somewhere before on DPC.  Just can''t remember where (tutorials?)  Hmmm.  As for this photo, the image could be rotated a bit to the right to make it level.  Some curves/levels might help give the sky some impact.  Also would consider a bump in color saturation.  Good luck.</td>', 'Ok...I know I''ve seen this statue somewhere before on DPC.  Just can''t remember where (tutorials?)  Hmmm.  As for this photo, the image could be rotated a bit to the right to make it level.  Some curves/levels might help give the sky some impact.  Also would consider a bump in color saturation.  Good luck.', '2005-04-05 13:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
