(1273192, 160230, 34192, '<td valign="top">i like the way this shot was done - head on.  Most people would take it from the side or just show the head.  This is much better - give the image depth. I''m not sure what would improve this image.  Best I can say is its cute.  But it really doesn''t have the WOW factor for me (my own judgement, not a defining moment type thing).  I''m giving you an 8 - 1-7 is technical, 8-10 are degrees of wow.  You got me to come back so you get +1 for that.  Thanks!</td>', 'i like the way this shot was done - head on.  Most people would take it from the side or just show the head.  This is much better - give the image depth. I''m not sure what would improve this image.  Best I can say is its cute.  But it really doesn''t have the WOW factor for me (my own judgement, not a defining moment type thing).  I''m giving you an 8 - 1-7 is technical, 8-10 are degrees of wow.  You got me to come back so you get +1 for that.  Thanks!', '2005-04-05 23:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
