(1273197, 161234, 4226, '<td valign="top">too noisy... looks like you have tried to brighten a very underexposed image..</td>', 'too noisy... looks like you have tried to brighten a very underexposed image..', '2005-04-05 23:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273198, 160946, 34192, '<td valign="top">I really wanted to take points off for this being an egg, but I couldn''t do that.  Technically, this is a beautiful shot.  I''m just tired of eggs.  And chessmen. And ducks. :)  I think the way you captured the fabric is incredible - the texture is right on target.  I am going to give you an 8; 1-7 are technical points, 8-10 are WOW factor points.  You got me to look twice and I still love the fabric depth even if I still hate the egg.  I can over look it in a shot this good.  I REALLY need to learn how to do this.  Thank you!</td>', 'I really wanted to take points off for this being an egg, but I couldn''t do that.  Technically, this is a beautiful shot.  I''m just tired of eggs.  And chessmen. And ducks. :)  I think the way you captured the fabric is incredible - the texture is right on target.  I am going to give you an 8; 1-7 are technical points, 8-10 are WOW factor points.  You got me to look twice and I still love the fabric depth even if I still hate the egg.  I can over look it in a shot this good.  I REALLY need to learn how to do this.  Thank you!', '2005-04-05 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273199, 160812, 4226, '<td valign="top">Is that leaf real ? hmm interesting. I am not very fond of the too tight crop here..looks like you could have used some room on the left to let the shadow grow ..</td>', 'Is that leaf real ? hmm interesting. I am not very fond of the too tight crop here..looks like you could have used some room on the left to let the shadow grow ..', '2005-04-05 23:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273218, 160573, 34194, '<td valign="top">I think this shot might look better as a B&amp;W photo given that it is already rather monochromatic. Good expression and framing.</td>', 'I think this shot might look better as a B&W photo given that it is already rather monochromatic. Good expression and framing.', '2005-04-05 23:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1273222, 161295, 34194, '<td valign="top">Home brew?</td>', 'Home brew?', '2005-04-05 23:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
