(1274131, 161088, 30018, '<td valign="top">Very Nicely done!  My hat is off to you.  I''m glad everyone else like this shot as much as I did.  In a challenge that seemed to be dominated by the "beginning of time", your idea, and workmanship, has as, cream does, risen to the top.  My warmest congratulations to you on your 1st place finish.</td>', 'Very Nicely done!  My hat is off to you.  I''m glad everyone else like this shot as much as I did.  In a challenge that seemed to be dominated by the "beginning of time", your idea, and workmanship, has as, cream does, risen to the top.  My warmest congratulations to you on your 1st place finish.', '2005-04-06 07:15:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274132, 160732, 30018, '<td valign="top">This was one of my very favorite images in this Challenge.  Nicely done.  Congratulations!</td>', 'This was one of my very favorite images in this Challenge.  Nicely done.  Congratulations!', '2005-04-06 07:17:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274137, 160454, 30018, '<td valign="top">This should have finished much higher in the final voting.  I''m sure you will be putting this in the babies photo album.  It''s definately a keeper.  You did a great job on this shot.  Congrats...!</td>', 'This should have finished much higher in the final voting.  I''m sure you will be putting this in the babies photo album.  It''s definately a keeper.  You did a great job on this shot.  Congrats...!', '2005-04-06 07:20:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274141, 161295, 30018, '<td valign="top">Must be some people just didn''t get it.  I thought this image was outstanding.  Thought it would finish in the top 5.  I liked it a lot.  Very Nicely done...!</td>', 'Must be some people just didn''t get it.  I thought this image was outstanding.  Thought it would finish in the top 5.  I liked it a lot.  Very Nicely done...!', '2005-04-06 07:24:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274145, 160744, 30018, '<td valign="top">Interesting, lots of nice comments,  yet a very average score.  This was one of my very favorite shots.  I gave it a &lt;9&gt;.  Great cropping, great action, great idea, it all works for me.  Sorry you didn''t finish much higher.  Should have been in the top 5!  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting, lots of nice comments,  yet a very average score.  This was one of my very favorite shots.  I gave it a <9>.  Great cropping, great action, great idea, it all works for me.  Sorry you didn''t finish much higher.  Should have been in the top 5!  Very nicely done.', '2005-04-06 07:28:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274164, 161088, 23478, '<td valign="top">Congrats... it couldn''t happen to a nicer guy!  You deserve the blue... I really liked this photo.</td>', 'Congrats... it couldn''t happen to a nicer guy!  You deserve the blue... I really liked this photo.', '2005-04-06 07:47:03.000000', NULL, 0),
