(1274178, 161106, 20608, '<td valign="top">Hi Phillip, yes thats what i did. I took the sunset picture during a trip to Saipan and thought it really suited the challenge but as you know I could not submit an old picture nor could i simply shoot the whole pic again from my monitor or it would of broke the rules so i had to add something to this to make it original... enter the egyption pens.. Im happy with 16th place my highest to date Thank you everyone for nice comments.</td>', 'Hi Phillip, yes thats what i did. I took the sunset picture during a trip to Saipan and thought it really suited the challenge but as you know I could not submit an old picture nor could i simply shoot the whole pic again from my monitor or it would of broke the rules so i had to add something to this to make it original... enter the egyption pens.. Im happy with 16th place my highest to date Thank you everyone for nice comments.', '2005-04-06 08:02:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274186, 161147, 15766, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the positive critiques.<br/> <br/>But I don''t understand the "seriously weak link to the challenge" comment. It is a photo of egrets mating. It is the beginning of a new life.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all the positive critiques. But I don''t understand the "seriously weak link to the challenge" comment. It is a photo of egrets mating. It is the beginning of a new life. ', '2005-04-06 08:07:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(1274191, 161286, 23394, '<td valign="top">yikes!  you don''t want to be following my trends (my highest finish was followed by my worst finish...).  maybe you got hit with the starbucks ubiquity coefficent reversal factor?<br/> <br/>funny shot, but my guess is that out of about 300 images, viewers didn''t have time for it to completely register.</td>', 'yikes!  you don''t want to be following my trends (my highest finish was followed by my worst finish...).  maybe you got hit with the starbucks ubiquity coefficent reversal factor? funny shot, but my guess is that out of about 300 images, viewers didn''t have time for it to completely register.', '2005-04-06 08:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
