(1274738, 161018, 30214, '<td valign="top">OMG!!! How embarassing!<br/>I wouldn''t believe such a coincidence - but I swear I did not see this shot! Well, I guess great minds think alike :).  But why didn''t you submit it, or , for that matter, anything?<br/> <br/>Regarding one "faith-based" coumment - i did not expect this photo to be "controversial" (unlike my earlier <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=141309" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">entry</a>), but apparently it was - look at the histogram of votes and the number of 1, 2''s, and 3''s! I think it is wrong to judge people beliefs in a photo contest - but what can you do....<br/> <br/>Anyway, I am sorry if my photo offendend anyone, it did not mean to.<br/>And of course - thanks to all for many very nice comments! Always appreciated.<br/><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-06 11:41:30.</i></td>', 'OMG!!! How embarassing!I wouldn''t believe such a coincidence - but I swear I did not see this shot! Well, I guess great minds think alike :).  But why didn''t you submit it, or , for that matter, anything? Regarding one "faith-based" coumment - i did not expect this photo to be "controversial" (unlike my earlier entry), but apparently it was - look at the histogram of votes and the number of 1, 2''s, and 3''s! I think it is wrong to judge people beliefs in a photo contest - but what can you do.... Anyway, I am sorry if my photo offendend anyone, it did not mean to.And of course - thanks to all for many very nice comments! Always appreciated.', '2005-04-06 12:22:29.000000', '2005-04-06 12:41:30.000000', 0),
(1274739, 160274, 18349, '<td valign="top">This is stunning!!!  What gorgeous color and clarity!! :o)</td>', 'This is stunning!!!  What gorgeous color and clarity!! :o)', '2005-04-06 12:22:50.000000', NULL, 0),
