(1277298, 161125, 35229, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by legalbeagle:</b></div><hr/><i> Interesting subject - original.  Colours are a bit muted and the sky is over exposed - might have been better to frame the picture so that there was no skyline.  Details of the house are underexposed, and lack detail as a result. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Yes it would have been better to cut out the skyline. It was a hard photo to adjust, the brightness of the day was so strange.</td>', 'Originally posted by legalbeagle: Interesting subject - original.  Colours are a bit muted and the sky is over exposed - might have been better to frame the picture so that there was no skyline.  Details of the house are underexposed, and lack detail as a result.  Yes it would have been better to cut out the skyline. It was a hard photo to adjust, the brightness of the day was so strange.', '2005-04-07 13:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
