(1595616, 161104, 38149, '<td valign="top">I just spotted this picture and really like it.  We have just had some baby ducks born and they have no water to play in apart from a bucket we give them. (see mudhut - duck in a bucket!!) Its a lovely shot althought the focus is a little soft but its very difficult to take shots of moving animals I know.  Well done and keep taking nice shots like this.</td>', 'I just spotted this picture and really like it.  We have just had some baby ducks born and they have no water to play in apart from a bucket we give them. (see mudhut - duck in a bucket!!) Its a lovely shot althought the focus is a little soft but its very difficult to take shots of moving animals I know.  Well done and keep taking nice shots like this.', '2005-08-08 17:25:58.000000', NULL, 0),
